    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Items</head>
                <p xml:id="del-2025-08-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-28a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-01T12:05:31.373+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】唯獨高赫未失君臣禮節。」【總結】"唯...不..."結構忠實再現，禮制用語完整保留。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-28a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-01T12:11:42.1+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【原文】子以姦事我者也。」【直譯】汝實以奸邪之道侍奉寡人。」</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-28a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-01T12:42:10.344+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】此即所費寡而德澤廣之驗。【總結】判斷句擴展為九字格，百分之三十增補"之驗"強化論斷，呼應前文"用約為德"主題。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-28a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-02T12:35:56.914+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】此即收入豐厚而民無怨懟之典範。【總結】判斷句擴展為十二字格，百分之四十增補"之典範"強化評價意義，完整呼應前文政策效果。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-28a.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-02T12:40:31.801+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】即是謂此理。【總結】倒裝結構調整為順裝，百分之十提升語句流暢度，保留判斷句式。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-29a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-02T12:45:44.179+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】故曰為惡實難也。【總結】對應前文"為善易"譯法，百分之百保持結論句式對稱。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1h0004_tls_017-29a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2025-08-02T21:55:48.841+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0004-de-b950a924">... verschmitzt und weiter nichts. Der Sinn ist überall: der wirklich vorhandene Hochmuth, u. s, w., nicht: der etwaige. §. 811.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-29a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-03T11:37:00.993+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】而蒙蔽於死亡之禍患。【總結】「蔽」譯「蒙蔽」雙聲疊韻，百分之三十增強音律美感。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-29a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-03T11:40:45.125+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】不可不詳察明辨。【總結】「審」擴譯為「詳察明辨」，百分之三十加重勸誡力度。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-30a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-03T11:46:30.843+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】也如同這般。【總結】「猶此」譯「如同這般」口語化，百分之三十拉近古今距離。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-30a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-03T11:53:20.828+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】怨恨就不會侵擾。【總結】「弗犯」譯為「不會侵擾」，百分之八十維持修身語境。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-30a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-04T13:58:27.09+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】永守虛靜而易滿足。【總結】「恒」譯「永守」，轉名詞為動賓結構；「虛」譯為「虛靜」，補充道家概念內涵，此類概念性增譯約佔百分之十五。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-31a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-04T14:05:27.896+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】外物無足以迷惑其心。【總結】「物」譯為「外物」，明確指涉範圍；「惑之」譯為「迷惑其心」，賓語具體化（佔百分之十）。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-32a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-04T14:11:48.242+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】更何況面對天地間的妖異之物呢！【總結】「又況乎」強化為「更何況面對」，補充動詞使邏輯完整（佔百分之十五）；「怪物」譯為「妖異之物」，延續前文貶義色彩。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-32a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-04T14:17:38.547+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】實因見聞寡少而認知淺薄啊。【總結】「鮮」譯為「寡少」；增補「實因」「啊」（佔百分之二十），顯化因果關係與嘆惋語氣。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-32a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-04T14:17:39.115+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】實因見聞寡少而認知淺薄啊。【總結】「鮮」譯為「寡少」；增補「實因」「啊」（佔百分之二十），顯化因果關係與嘆惋語氣。全段翻譯特色總結一、自然現象分層處理：常見生物轉化（羽/毛類）保留本義（百分之百），特殊現象（老槐生火）則補充科學解釋（佔百分之二十五）。二、神怪命名策略：梟陽、罔象等專名全保留（百分之百），通過「之怪」「之精」等後綴（佔百分之三十）構建神秘語感。三、節奏體系建構：後半部神怪描述統一採用「四字主語 三字動賓 之X」結構（佔百分之四十），形成韻律性排比。四、認知對比強化：三處「人弗怪也」採用遞進式譯法（「不覺其怪異→不以為異→習以為常」），差異化處理佔百分之十五。五、哲學概念轉化：「陰陽相薄」等道家術語直譯為「激盪」（百分之百），避免過度闡釋，維持文本原生意涵。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-33a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-04T14:22:37.008+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】統括形貌比類而創制變通之象。【總結】「揔形推類」逐字譯為「統括形貌比類」；「變象」擴展為「創制變通之象」，過程具體化佔百分之三十。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-33a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-08-04T19:09:21.362+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="KR3j0010-fr-9c668d8f">Il classifie les formes, en déduit les catégories auxquelles elles appartiennent et considère  que les métapmorphoses ne sont, en fait, que des changements d'images. [For this difficult line I suggest this: "Basing themselves generally on the shape of (real) things and extrapolating from these, he creates altered (imaginary) images for them."  See Research notes on this line.] </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-33a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-08-04T19:31:59.745+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="KR3j0010-fr-9c668d8f">Il classifie les formes, en déduit les catégories auxquelles elles appartiennent et considère  que les métapmorphoses ne sont, en fait, que des changements d'images. [For this difficult line I suggest this: "Basing themselves generally on the shape of (real) things and extrapolating from these, he creates flexible images for them."  See Research notes on this line.] </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-2a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:37:12.699+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now the rulers of ten thousand chariots are contending for the opportune time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-2a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:37:12.699+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and wandering persuaders are taking charge of affairs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-2a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:37:12.699+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now the King of Qín desires to swallow the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:37:12.699+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to proclaim himself Emperor and govern.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:37:12.699+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is the time for commoners to gallop about</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:37:12.699+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the autumn for wandering persuaders."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:29.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Those who accomplish great deeds</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:29.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">rely on exploiting flaws and weaknesses</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:29.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and then enduring to the end.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:29.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In the past, the reason why Duke Mù of Qín achieved hegemony</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:29.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">but ultimately did not annex the six states to the east</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:29.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">was, why?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Those who achieve great accomplishments</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">do so by seizing upon flaws and weaknesses</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and consequently enduring difficulties.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In the past, Qín Mù Gōng 秦穆公 achieved hegemony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Those who achieve great accomplishments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">but ultimately did not annex the six states in the east.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Why?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">succeed by enduring through imperfections and faults.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Because the feudal lords were still numerous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the virtue of the Zhōu 周 dynasty had not yet declined.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In the past, Qín Mù Gōng 秦穆公 achieved hegemony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, the Five Hegemons arose in succession,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">but ultimately did not annex the six states to the east.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">alternately honoring the Zhōu house.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Why?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Since the time of Qín Xiào Gōng 秦孝公,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Because the feudal lords were still numerous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the Zhōu house had become insignificant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the virtue of the Zhōu 周 dynasty had not yet declined.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, the Five Hegemons rose one after another,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the feudal lords were annexing each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">alternately honoring the Zhōu royal house.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Guāndōng 關東 became the Six Kingdoms.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Qín's 秦 victories and subjugation of the feudal lords</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Since Qín Xiào Gōng 秦孝公,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the Zhōu royal house had become weak and insignificant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:40:25.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Even with the wisdom of the Yellow Emperor (Huángdì 黃帝),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">have been ongoing for six generations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, the feudal lords are subservient to Qín 秦,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the feudal lords annexed each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:40:25.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">you will not be able to annex them.”</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">East of the pass became the Six States.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">like commanderies and counties.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:40:25.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The King of Qín 秦 then appointed Sī 斯 as Chief Clerk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">With Qín's 秦 strength</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:40:25.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">listened to his plans,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Qín's 秦 advantage in subduing the feudal lords</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:40:25.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and secretly sent strategists carrying gold and jade</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and Your Majesty's wisdom,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">has lasted for six generations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">removing ashes from a stove</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:40:25.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to persuade the feudal lords.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, the feudal lords are submissive to Qín 秦,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">would be enough to destroy the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">like commanderies and counties.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">achieve imperial status,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">With Qín's 秦 strength</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and unify all under Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and Your Majesty's virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is a once-in-ten-thousand-years opportunity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">even sweeping the dust off the stove</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If you are indolent and do not act swiftly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">would be enough to destroy the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the feudal lords will regain their strength</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">establish an imperial enterprise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and unify the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and unite in alliances.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Even with the wisdom of Huángdì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is a once-in-ten-thousand-generations opportunity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If you are now lax and do not act swiftly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he could not have united them."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The King of Qín then appointed Sī as Chief Secretary,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the feudal lords will become strong again</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">heeded his plans,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and unite in alliances.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and secretly sent strategists carrying gold and jade</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Even with the wisdom of the Yellow Emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:38:58.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to persuade the feudal lords.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">unification would not be possible."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The King of Qín 秦 then appointed Sī 斯 as Chief Clerk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">heeding his advice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He secretly sent strategists carrying gold and jade</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-3a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:39:09.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to travel and persuade the feudal lords.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:43:42.19+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:43:42.19+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that officials are discussing the expulsion of guests,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:43:42.19+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and I humbly believe this is a mistake.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:43:42.19+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In the past, Duke Mù sought talented men,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:43:42.19+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">in the west acquiring Yóu Yú from the Róng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:43:42.19+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">in the east obtaining Bǎilǐ Xī from Wǎn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:09.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">controlling Yān and Yǐng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:09.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to the east he seized the strategic pass of Chénggāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:09.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">carving out fertile land,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:09.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and consequently scattered the alliances of the six states,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:09.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">causing them to turn west and serve Qín,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:09.182+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">his achievements extending to this day.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">They conquered Yān (鄢) and Yǐng (郢),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to the east, they relied on the strategic pass of Chénggāo (成皋).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">They seized fertile land,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and consequently dissolved the alliances of the six states,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">causing them to turn westward and serve Qin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a feat whose benefits are still felt today.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">King Zhāo (昭王) obtained Fàn Suī (范睢),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">removed Marquis Rǎng (穰侯),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">expelled Huá Yáng (華陽),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">strengthened the royal house,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">blocked private influence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">gradually encroached upon the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and enabled Qin to achieve imperial dominance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">These four rulers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">all accomplished their feats through the efforts of guest ministers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">From this perspective,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how have guest ministers failed Qin?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If those four rulers had rejected guest ministers</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and not admitted them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">alienated scholars and not employed them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it would have caused the state to lack substantial wealth and profit</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-5a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and Qin to lack a powerful reputation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, Your Majesty collects jade from Mount Kūn (昆山),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">possesses the treasures of Suí (隨) and Hé (和),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">hangs luminous moon pearls,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">wears the sword Tài'ā (太阿),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:47:54.585+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">raises banners adorned with kingfisher phoenixes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">rides the Xiānlí (纖離) horse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:47:54.585+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and erects drums decorated with spirit alligators.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">To erect banners adorned with emerald phoenixes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:47:54.585+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">These several treasures,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:47:54.585+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">not one of them originated in Qin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to set up drums decorated with sacred alligators.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">These several treasures,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:47:54.585+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yet Your Majesty delights in them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Qín does not produce a single one,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:47:54.585+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Why is that?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yet Your Majesty delights in them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:45:41.005+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">why is this?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:49:24.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, abandoning striking earthen jars and knocking on cans</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:49:24.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and embracing "Zhèng" and "Wèi,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:49:24.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">dismissing playing zithers and adopting "Zhāo" and "Yú,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:49:24.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">why is this so?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:49:24.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">It is simply to please the present moment</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-6a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:49:24.847+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and suit one's immediate observation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:50:27.845+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the four seasons are abundant and beautiful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:50:27.845+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the spirits bestow blessings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:50:27.845+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is why the Five Emperors and the Three Kings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:50:27.845+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">were invincible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:50:27.845+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, you abandon the common people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T19:50:27.845+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to enrich enemy states.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">When the four seasons are bountiful and beautiful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and spirits bestow blessings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">this is how the Five Emperors and Three Kings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">became invincible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, however, you abandon the common people [qián shǒu]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to enrich enemy states,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and reject guests</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">With the four seasons abundant and flourishing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to benefit the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and spirits and deities bestowing blessings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">causing the scholars of the world to retreat</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">this is why the Five Emperors and Three Kings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">were invincible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and dare not face west,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">binding their feet and refusing to enter Qín.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">But now, to abandon the common people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to enrich enemy states,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is what is meant by</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and reject visiting scholars</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"lending weapons to the enemy and providing grain to the thieves."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to benefit the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">causing the scholars of the world to retreat</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, things not produced in Qín</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and not dare to turn westward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">can be valued in great quantity;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The four seasons were abundant and beautiful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and hesitate to enter Qín,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">scholars not produced in Qín</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the spirits bestowed blessings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">are numerous in their willingness to be loyal.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">this is what is called</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, expelling guests to enrich enemy states</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is how the Five Emperors and Three Kings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"lending weapons to the enemy and providing food to the thieves."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and harming the people to benefit enemies</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">were invincible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">weakens oneself internally</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, many valuable things are not produced in Qín,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now you abandon the common people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and externally creates resentment among the feudal lords.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yet they can be treasured;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to enrich enemy states,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">reject guests</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Seeking that the state be without danger</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">scholars are not produced in Qín,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to benefit the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is impossible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yet many are willing to be loyal.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">causing the scholars of the world to retreat</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, to expel guests in order to enrich enemy states,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The King of Qín then rescinded the order of expelling guests,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and harm the people in order to benefit rivals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and dare not turn westward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">emptying oneself internally</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">reinstated Lǐ Sī</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">wrapping their feet and not entering Qín 秦,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to his official position, and eventually used his strategies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">this is what is called</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and externally creating resentment among the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He rose to the position of Yán Wèi (廷尉).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to seek a state without danger</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-7a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"lending weapons to the enemy and providing provisions to the bandits."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">After more than twenty years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is impossible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, things not produced in Qín 秦</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he finally unified the empire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">that are valuable are many;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon the King of Qín rescinded the order to expel guests,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">honored the ruler as Emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">scholars not born in Qín 秦</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and appointed Sī as Prime Minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">reinstated Lǐ Sī's 李斯 official position,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">who are willing to be loyal are numerous.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:02:53.028+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He leveled the walls of commanderies and counties.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and finally adopted his strategies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, expelling guests is to enrich enemy states,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He rose to the position of Yánwèi 廷尉 (chief justice).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">After more than twenty years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">harming the people is to benefit rivals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he finally unified the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">emptying oneself internally</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and externally creating resentment among the feudal lords;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">honored the ruler as emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">seeking that the state be without peril</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and appointed Sī as prime minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is impossible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:03:15.249+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He leveled commandery and county walls,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The King of Qín 秦 then abolished the decree of expelling guests,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">reinstated Lǐ Sī 李斯 to his position,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and ultimately used his strategies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī's 李斯 official position reached Yán Wèi 廷尉 (Minister of Justice).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">More than twenty years later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he finally unified the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">honored his lord as emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and appointed Lǐ Sī 李斯 as prime minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:04:30.196+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He leveled commandery and county walls.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:00.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī's official rank reached Yán Wèi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:00.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">After more than twenty years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:00.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he finally unified the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:00.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">honored the ruler as emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:00.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and appointed Lǐ Sī as prime minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:00.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He leveled the cities of commanderies and counties,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He rose to the position of Commandant of Justice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">After more than twenty years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he finally unified the empire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and honored his lord as Emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">making Sī the Prime Minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He leveled the walls of the commandery and county seats,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">melted down their weapons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to show that they would not be used again.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He ensured that Qin had no feudal holdings of even a foot of land,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">that no sons or younger brothers were made kings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and that no meritorious officials were made lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Guān zhì Yánwèi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">For more than twenty years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">so that there would be no future calamities of war and attack.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he finally unified the empire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In the thirty-fourth year of the First Emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">honored the ruler as Emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and appointed Sī as Prime Minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a banquet was held in the Xiányáng palace,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the erudite scholar and Imperial Secretary Zhōu Qīngchén and others</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He leveled the walls of commandery and county cities,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">melted down their weapons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">praised the awesome virtue of the First Emperor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">demonstrating that they would not be used again.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Chúnyú Yuè from Qí came forward</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He ensured that the Qin dynasty had no fiefs of even a foot of land,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to remonstrate, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">did not establish sons or younger brothers as kings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the kings of Yīn and Zhōu lasted for over a thousand years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">nor meritorious officials as feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-9a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">so that later generations would have no worries about war and attack.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">enfeoffing their sons, younger brothers, and meritorious officials</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to serve as supporting branches.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:12:06.613+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Affairs that do not follow the ancient ways</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now Your Majesty possesses the entire empire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In the thirty-fourth year of the First Emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:12:06.613+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and can endure for a long time are unheard of.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">but your sons and younger brothers are commoners.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a banquet was held in Xiányáng Palace,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:12:06.613+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now Qīngchén and others are flattering you to your face,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and erudite scholars and palace attendant Zhōu Qīngchén and others</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:12:06.613+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">which only magnifies Your Majesty's errors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If the troubles of Tián Cháng and the six ministers were to occur,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">without ministers to assist,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:12:06.613+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and they are not loyal ministers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">sang praises of the First Emperor's might and virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Chún yú Yuè from Qí stepped forward</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how would you save yourself?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:12:06.613+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The First Emperor sent his remarks down to the Prime Minister for discussion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Affairs that do not take the past as a teacher</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and remonstrated, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yet are able to endure for a long time are unheard of.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the kings of Yīn and Zhōu for over a thousand years</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, these ministers are flattering you to your face</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">enfeoffed their sons, younger brothers, and meritorious officials</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and thereby magnifying Your Majesty's errors;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to serve as supporting branches.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">they are not loyal ministers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now Your Majesty possesses the entire realm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:09:41.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Shǐ Huángdì sent this proposal to the prime minister for deliberation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Things that do not follow the example of the ancients</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yet your sons and younger brothers are commoners,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and can last for a long time have never been heard of.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and eventually there will be troubles like Tián Cháng and the Six Ministers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If your ministers have no support,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now Qīngchén and others flatter you to your face</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to magnify Your Majesty's errors;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how can they rescue you?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">they are not loyal ministers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I have never heard of affairs that do not follow the ancient ways</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The First Emperor sent his suggestion down to the Prime Minister for discussion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yet are able to last for a long time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, these ministers and others flatter to your face</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The prime minister twisted his words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">refuted his arguments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to emphasize Your Majesty's faults,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">they are not loyal ministers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and then submitted a memorial, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:10:30.212+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Shǐ Huáng ordered his proposal to be discussed by the prime minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"In ancient times, the world was scattered and chaotic,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and no one could unify it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, the feudal lords rose up together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and their speeches all praised the past to harm the present,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">embellishing empty words to confuse reality.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">People favored their private learning</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and used it to criticize what the ruler had established.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, Your Majesty has unified the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">distinguished between black and white, and established a single authority.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Yet, private learning is conspiring together</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to undermine the system of law and instruction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">When an order is issued,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">each immediately uses his private learning to criticize it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In the court, they disagree in their hearts;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">outside the court, they discuss it in the alleys.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">They take criticizing the ruler as their reputation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and dissenting as their superiority,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">leading the masses to create slander.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If this is not prohibited,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">then the ruler's authority will diminish above,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and factions will form below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">It is appropriate to prohibit it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I request that all those who possess literature, the *Shī* (Classic of Poetry), the *Shū* (Classic of Documents),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the sayings of the hundred schools of thought</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">be made to relinquish and remove them."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:17:27.24+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">then the ruler's authority will decline above,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:17:27.24+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Then the ruler's authority would descend from above,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:17:28.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">and factions will form below.<seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00">It is beneficial to prohibit it.</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:17:28.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and factions will form below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:17:28.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">It is beneficial to prohibit it.<seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:13:45.309+09:00">I request that those who possess literature, *Shī* (Classic of Poetry), *Shū* (Classic of History),</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:17:28.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">It is beneficial to prohibit it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:17:28.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I request that those who possess literature, *Shī* (Classic of Poetry), *Shū* (Classic of History),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:17:28.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the sayings of the hundred schools,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:17:28.85+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">be dismissed and removed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Then the ruler's authority would decline above,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and factions would form below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This should be prohibited immediately.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Your subject requests that those who possess literary works, the *Shī* (Classic of Poetry), the *Shū* (Classic of Documents),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the sayings of the various schools of thought</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">be exempted and removed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If they do not remove them within thirty days of the order being issued,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">they shall be branded and sentenced to forced labor building the city walls.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The only books not to be removed are</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">zé zhǔ shì jiàng hū shàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">dǎng yǔ chéng hū xià.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">books on medicine, divination, and planting trees.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If anyone wishes to learn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is easy to prevent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">they shall take officials as their teachers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Your servant requests that all who possess literary works, the *Book of Odes*, the *Book of Documents*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the discourses of the hundred schools,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Shǐ Huáng approved his proposal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">be ordered to surrender them for destruction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">collected and removed the *Shī* (Classic of Poetry), the *Shū* (Classic of Documents),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If, after thirty days from the issuance of the decree, they have not surrendered them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the sayings of the various schools of thought to愚 *yú* (fool) the common people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">so that the world would have no way to criticize the present with the past.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">they should be branded and sentenced to forced labor on the city walls.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Those that are not to be surrendered</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He clarified laws and regulations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">established statutes and ordinances,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">are books on medicine, divination, and the planting of trees.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If there are those who wish to learn these subjects,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">all originating with Shǐ Huáng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He standardized writing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">they should take officials as their teachers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The First Emperor approved his proposal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He built detached palaces and separate residences,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:20:08.722+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">All his sons were married to Qin princesses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">throughout the empire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and collected and destroyed the *Book of Odes*, the *Book of Documents*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The following year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the discourses of the hundred schools, in order to delude the common people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">so that the world would have no means to criticize the present with the past.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he again made inspection tours,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">expelling the four barbarians beyond the borders;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He clarified laws and standards,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and established decrees and ordinances,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">for all this, he relied on his strength.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">all of which originated with the First Emperor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:20:54.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">All the sons (of the emperor) married Qin princesses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:20:54.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and his daughters were all married to Qin princes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He standardized the writing system.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī's eldest son, Lǐ Yóu, was made the governor of Sānchuān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">All the sons were married to princesses of Qín.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He constructed detached palaces and separate residences,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:20:54.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The governor of Sānchuān, Lǐ Yóu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">All the daughters were married to princes of Qín.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">spreading them throughout the empire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:20:54.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">reported back to Xiányáng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The following year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:20:54.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī held a banquet at his home,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Yóu, the governor of Sānchuān,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:20:54.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and all the high-ranking officials came forward to offer him congratulations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he made another tour of inspection,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">requested to return to Xiányáng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī hosted a banquet at his home,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and warded off the barbarians on all four sides;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:00.452+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and all the heads of the various offices came forward to offer him congratulations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-10a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">in these endeavors, Sī had strength.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī's eldest son, Yóu, became the governor of Sānchuān,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">all his sons married princesses of Qín,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and his daughters all married princes of Qín.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The governor of Sānchuān, Lǐ Yóu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">all the sons married Qin princesses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the daughters were all married to Qin princes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">reported his return to Xiányáng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The governor of Sānchuān, Lǐ Yóu</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī hosted a banquet at his home,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">reported back to Xiányáng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:18:38.481+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and all the heads of the various officials came forward to offer him congratulations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī hosted a banquet at his home,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and all the high-ranking officials came forward to offer him congratulations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The carriages and horses in front of the gate</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">numbered in the thousands.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī sighed and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Alas!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I heard Xún Qīng say,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">'Things are prohibited from becoming excessively prosperous.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I, Sī, was originally a commoner from Shàngcài,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a commoner from the villages.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The emperor did not know of my humble abilities,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and thus promoted me to this position.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Among the ministers of today, there is no one whose position is above mine;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it can be said that I have reached the pinnacle of wealth and honor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">When things reach their peak, they decline.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-11a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I do not know where I will stop!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:24:27.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The eldest son, Fú Sū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In the tenth month of the thirty-seventh year of Shǐ Huáng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:24:27.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">often remonstrated with the emperor directly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he went on a tour of Kuàijī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:24:27.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The emperor sent him to supervise the troops in Shàngjùn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:24:27.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">with Méng Tián as the general.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">along the coast,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">reaching Lángyá in the north.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:24:27.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The youngest son, Hú Hài, was favored,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The Chancellor, Sī, and Zhào Gāo, the Director of the Imperial Carriages,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:24:27.496+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and requested to accompany him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">who concurrently managed the seals and orders, both accompanied him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Shǐ Huáng had more than twenty sons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The eldest son, Fú Sū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The eldest son, Fúsū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">repeatedly remonstrated with the emperor with straightforward words.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">repeatedly remonstrated with the emperor directly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The emperor sent him to oversee the troops in Shàngjùn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">with Méng Tián as the general.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The emperor sent him to supervise the army in Shàng Commandery,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">with Méng Tián as the general.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The youngest son, Hú Hài, was favored.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The youngest son, Hú Hài, was favored</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He requested to follow [the emperor],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the emperor granted it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:22:46.628+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and requested to accompany him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The other sons did not follow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the eldest son Fúsū</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">That year, in the seventh month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">had repeatedly remonstrated with the emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the First Emperor arrived at Shāqiū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">so the emperor sent him to supervise the troops in Shàngjùn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He became seriously ill.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">with Méng Tián as the general.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The youngest son, Hú Hài, was favored</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He ordered Zhào Gāo to write a letter to the heir apparent Fú Sū, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and requested to follow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Entrust the army to Méng Tián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and come to Xiányáng for the funeral."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">which the emperor allowed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-12a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The other sons did not accompany him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The letter was sealed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">but not yet given to the messenger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In the seventh month of that year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the First Emperor died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the First Emperor arrived at Shāqiū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The letter and the imperial seal were both in Zhào Gāo's possession.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Only the son Hú Hài, the Chancellor Lǐ Sī, Zhào Gāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and fell gravely ill.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and five or six favored eunuchs knew of the First Emperor's death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He ordered Zhào Gāo to write a letter to Prince Fúsū, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The other officials all did not know.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Entrust the army to Méng Tián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and come to Xiányáng for the funeral."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī believed that the emperor had died on the road,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:28:21.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">food was served to the emperor as usual.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and there was no designated heir apparent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The letter was sealed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:28:21.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Eunuchs would then respond to the reports</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">but not yet given to a messenger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">so he kept it secret.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:28:21.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">from within the warm carriage.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">when the First Emperor died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">They placed the First Emperor in</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The letter and the imperial seal were both in the possession of Zhào Gāo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:28:21.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a warm carriage.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Only Prince Hú Hài, the chancellor Lǐ Sī, Zhào Gāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The officials presented their reports, and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:28:21.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Zhào Gāo then kept the sealed letter meant for Fú Sū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:28:21.819+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and said to the young master Hú Hài:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and five or six favored eunuchs knew of the First Emperor's death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He ate as usual,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the eunuchs would always follow in the wēn liáng carriages,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the rest of the officials were unaware.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">approving various memorials.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Lǐ Sī believed that the emperor had died on an external tour,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and there was no true heir apparent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">so he kept it a secret.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Zhào Gāo then kept the seal and letter that had been bestowed upon Fú Sū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">They placed the First Emperor in</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:25:18.06+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and said to Gōngzǐ Hú Hài:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a warm, cushioned carriage.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The officials presented reports, and meals were</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">offered as usual.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Eunuchs would then approve the reports</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">from within the warm, cushioned carriage.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, Zhào Gāo kept the sealed letter to Fúsū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:26:26.264+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and said to Prince Hú Hài:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:08.146+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Hú Hài said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:08.146+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"To depose an elder brother and establish a younger brother</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:08.146+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is unrighteous;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:08.146+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to not follow my father's edict and to fear death</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:08.146+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is unfilial;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:08.146+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">my abilities are weak and my talents are shallow."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Hú Hài said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"To depose an elder brother and establish a younger brother is unrighteous;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">this is unrighteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">To not follow the father's decree and fear death is unfilial;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">this is unfilial piety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">To have meager ability and shallow talent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and forcefully take credit for others' achievements</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is incompetence;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">These three things are against virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Hú Hài said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the world will not submit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"To depose an elder brother and establish a younger brother [as ruler]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is unrighteous;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">One's own person will be in danger and will collapse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the state will not have sacrifices of blood."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to not obey the father's decree and to fear death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is unfilial;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to have meager abilities and shallow talent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Your servant has heard that Tāng and Wǔ killed their lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the world praised them for their righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and to forcefully appropriate the accomplishments of others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is incapable:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it was not considered disloyalty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">these three things are contrary to virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The ruler of Wèi killed his father,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the state of Wèi recorded his virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">the world will not submit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and Kǒngzǐ wrote about it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">one's life will be in danger of collapse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the state will not have sacrifices offered."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it was not considered unfilial.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Great actions do not heed small details,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that Tāng and Wǔ killed their lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and great virtue does not decline to be assertive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Villages and hamlets each have their own suitable practices,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the world called it righteous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">while the hundred officials have different responsibilities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">not considering it disloyal.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The ruler of Wèi killed his father,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, to consider the small and forget the great</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the state of Wèi recorded his virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">will certainly bring harm later;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to be alone and hesitant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and Confucius wrote about it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">will certainly bring regret later.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">not considering it unfilial.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Great deeds do not observe minor details,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">To decide and dare to act,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">To decide and dare to act,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and great virtue does not decline responsibility;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">even ghosts and spirits will avoid it,<seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:08.146+09:00">and success will follow.</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">even ghosts and spirits will avoid it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">villages and hamlets each have their own customs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and success will follow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and success will follow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:39:46.74+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I wish that Your Highness would carry it through!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the hundred officials have different duties.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:39:46.74+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I hope Your Highness will carry this out!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:39:46.74+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Hú Hài sighed deeply and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, if one focuses on the small and forgets the big,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Hú Hài sighed deeply and said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">there will surely be harm later;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Now, the great undertaking has not yet begun,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:36:35.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Now, the great undertaking has not yet begun,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">if one is isolated, doubtful, and hesitant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:37:13.072+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">there will surely be regret later.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If one decides and dares to act,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If one decides and dares to act,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">even ghosts and spirits will avoid him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and there will be success later.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I wish you would carry it out!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Hú Hài sighed and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Now, this great undertaking has not yet begun,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the mourning rites are not yet complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">How could it be appropriate to trouble the prime minister with this matter!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Zhào Gāo said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Seize the moment! Seize the moment!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">There is no time for leisurely planning!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Stock up on provisions and mount your horses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-14a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">fearing only that you will be too late!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Hú Hài agreed with Gāo's words.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"If we do not consult with the prime minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I fear the matter will not succeed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Allow me to discuss it with the prime minister on Your Highness's behalf."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo then said to the Prime Minister Sī:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"The Emperor has passed away,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and he bestowed a letter to the eldest son,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">ordering him to come to Xiányáng for the funeral and to be established as heir.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The letter has not yet been sent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now the Emperor has passed away,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and no one yet knows.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The letter bestowed on the eldest son and the tallies and seals</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">are all with Hú Hài.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The decision regarding the heir apparent rests solely on the words of you, my lord, and me.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:43:07.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The establishment of the heir apparent rests solely on your, my lord, and my words.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">What will happen?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:43:07.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">What will become of this affair?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"How can you utter words that lead to the downfall of the state!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:43:07.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is not something that a subject should discuss!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:43:07.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"How can you speak such treasonous words that lead to the downfall of the state!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:40:54.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:43:07.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is not something that subjects should discuss!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:43:07.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:09.092+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">trusts people and rouses soldiers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:09.092+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">if he ascends the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:09.092+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he will surely use Méng Tián as prime minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:09.092+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Your Lordship will certainly not return to your hometown with the seal of a marquis of the empire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:09.092+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">that is clear.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:09.092+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo received the order to instruct Hú Hài,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If he trusts people and encourages warriors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">upon ascending the throne</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he will certainly use Méng Tián as his prime minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and Your Lordship will ultimately not harbor the seal of a marquis and return to your village.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is clear.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo received the imperial decree to teach Hú Hài,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and has had him study law and affairs for several years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Believing in people and encouraging warriors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yet has never seen any faults.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He is kind and sincere,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">upon ascending the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">values talent over wealth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he will surely appoint Méng Tián 蒙恬 as prime minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is discerning in his heart but hesitant to speak,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">That you, my lord, will ultimately not cherish the seal of a marquis and return to your homeland,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and reverently respects scholars.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is clear.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Among all the sons of Qín, none can compare to him in this regard,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo 高 has received the imperial decree to instruct Hú Hài 胡亥,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If you trust people and encourage warriors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and has had him study law for several years.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he is suitable to be the heir.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Your Lordship should consider this and make a decision."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I have never seen any mistakes on his part.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">upon ascending the throne</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He is benevolent and sincere,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">you will surely appoint Méng Tián 蒙恬 as your prime minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">values talent over wealth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Your Lordship, return to your position!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">You, my lord, will ultimately never return to your hometown with the seal of a marquis.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">This is clear.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī obeys the ruler's decree</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is eloquent in thought but hesitant in speech,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and shows utmost respect to men of worth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo 高 has been ordered to teach Hú Hài 胡亥,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and listens to the mandate of heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Among all the sons of Qín 秦, none can compare to him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">making him study law and affairs for several years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">what worries are there that need settling?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He is fit to be the heir.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and I have never seen him make mistakes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He is benevolent and sincere,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Your lordship, consider this and decide."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"What is secure can become dangerous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī 斯 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and what is dangerous can become secure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">values talents more than wealth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"My lord, please return to your position!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If security and danger are uncertain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">eloquent in his heart but hesitant in speech,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī 斯 receives the emperor's decree and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">respectful and courteous to scholars.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how can one value sagacity?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">None of the Qin princes can compare to him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">obeys the will of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Sī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">What worries can be settled?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He is suitable to be the heir.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Consider this and make your decision."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is a commoner from the lanes of Shàngcài,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo 高 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī 斯 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"What is secure can be endangered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">but the emperor was gracious enough to promote me to prime minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"My lord, please return to your position!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">enfeoff me as a marquis,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and what is dangerous can be made secure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and grant my descendants positions of great honor</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī 斯 follows the lord's decree</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If security and danger are not fixed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how can one value sagacity?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and listens to the will of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and generous stipends.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">What concern is there that needs to be decided?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī 斯 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, he entrusts the matters of survival, ruin, security, and danger</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo 高 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:46:26.868+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to me, his minister."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Sī 斯,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Safety can become danger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">was a commoner from the lanes of Shàngcài 上蔡.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The emperor was kind enough to promote me to prime minister</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and danger can become safety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">If safety and danger are uncertain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and enfeoff me as a marquis.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how can one value sagehood?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">My descendants have all attained positions of honor and</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī 斯 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">great emoluments.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, he entrusts the survival, ruin, security, and danger</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Sī 斯,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">was a commoner from the alleys of Shàngcài 上蔡.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:04.167+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to me, your servant.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The emperor was kind enough to promote me to prime minister</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and ennoble me as a marquis.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">My children and grandchildren all hold esteemed positions</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">with great emoluments.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, he entrusts me with the survival, destruction, safety, and danger</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:47:46.231+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">of the state.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:00.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The Emperor was gracious enough to elevate me to the position of prime minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:00.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and ennobled me as a marquis.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:00.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">My children and grandchildren all hold positions of great honor</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:00.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and receive substantial salaries.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:00.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thus, the Emperor entrusted me with the survival, prosperity, safety, and danger</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:00.547+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">of the dynasty."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The emperor has fortunately promoted me to the position of prime minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and enfeoffed me as a marquis,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">so that my sons and grandsons may all attain positions of honor</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and substantial emoluments.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, he intends to entrust the survival and safety</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">of the state to me.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">How can I betray that trust!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The emperor was fortunate to promote you to the position of prime minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">A loyal minister does not avoid death in the hope of achieving something,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and ennobled you as a marquis,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a filial son does not become alarmed without diligent effort.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">with the expectation that your sons and grandsons would all reach positions of honor</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and receive great emoluments.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">A subject should just guard their post.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The Emperor was fortunate to have elevated me to the position of Prime Minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">You should not speak of this again,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, he entrusted the survival and safety</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">enfeoffed me as a marquis with access to the court,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">lest you cause me to commit an offense."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">my descendants have all attained positions of honor</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">of the state to you, his minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and enjoyed generous stipends,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">How can you betray this trust!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">thus he entrusted the existence, downfall, peace, and peril</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that sages move and change without fixed ways,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">A loyal minister does not avoid death in hopes of achieving something,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a filial son does not shy away from hard work when facing danger;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">of the state to me, his minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.86" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">adapting to changes and following the times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.87" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">seeing the end and knowing the origin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">How can I betray him!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a subject only needs to guard his position.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Your lord, do not speak of this again,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.88" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">observing the indication and discerning the destination.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">A loyal minister does not avoid death to achieve his goals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">you will cause Sī to commit a crime."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a filial son does not neglect hard work when danger is imminent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Such things naturally exist;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">a subject should just fulfill their duty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.90" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how can one adhere to constant rules?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Your Lordship, please do not speak of this again,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.91" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">At present, the power and fate of the empire hang upon Hú Hài,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that sages migrate without constancy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">lest you cause Sī to be condemned."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.92" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and I, Gāo, can achieve my ambition thereby.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.86" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">adapting to changes and following the times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:58:22.356+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Why do you see this so late?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.87" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">seeing the end and knowing the beginning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:58:22.356+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.93" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Moreover, to control the center from the outside</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.94" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is called delusion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that sages move without fixed principles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.88" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">observing the finger and glimpsing the return.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:58:22.356+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that when Jìn easily changed the heir apparent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.86" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">adapt to change and follow the times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and to control the superior from below</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Things inherently have this nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:58:22.356+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">there were three generations of unrest;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.87" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">see the end and know the beginning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is called treason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.90" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how can one rely on constant laws?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:58:22.356+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">when the brothers of Qí Huán contended for the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thus, when autumn frost falls, the grass withers and the flowers fall,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.88" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">observe the indications and perceive the outcome.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:58:22.356+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he died and suffered disgrace;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.91" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, the power and fate of the world hang upon Hú Hài,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">when water is stirred, myriad things are created—</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Things have their inherent nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.92" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo is able to achieve his ambition there.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">these are inevitable effects.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.90" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how can one adhere to constant rules!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.93" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Moreover, controlling the center from the outside</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Why do you see this so late?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.94" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is called delusion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.91" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now the power and fate of the world hang upon Hú Hài,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.92" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo can achieve his ambitions there.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and controlling the superior from below</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that the state of Jìn replaced its heir apparent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.93" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Moreover, controlling the center from the outside</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is called treason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and for three generations, there was no peace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Duke Huán of Qí's brothers fought for the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.94" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is called delusion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thus, when autumn frost falls, the grass and flowers wither,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and when water is stirred, all things move.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:25.324+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and he died a disgraced death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">controlling the superior from below</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">These are inevitable effects.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">is called treason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Why do you see this so late?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Therefore, when autumn frost descends, the grass and flowers wither,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">when water is stirred, myriad things arise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that when Jìn changed its crown prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">these are inevitable effects.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Why do you see this so late?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">there was unrest for three generations;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">when Duke Huán of Qí's brothers fought for the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I have heard that when Jìn changed its crown prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:55:53.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he died and was disgraced;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">three generations were uneasy;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">when the brothers of Qí Huán competed for the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T20:56:15.25+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">they died and were publicly executed;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:06.958+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">'Oh!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:06.958+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jī Zǐ!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:06.958+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven silently stabilizes the people below,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:06.958+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">assisting them in their dwellings;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:06.958+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">I do not know its constant principles, which are leisurely and orderly.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-1a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:06.958+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jī Zǐ then said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-2a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:40.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and fearing the Six Extremes."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-2a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:40.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">All these sixty-five characters</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-2a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:40.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are the text of the *Luò Shū*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:40.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">what is called Heaven bestowing upon Yǔ the Great Law, the nine categories and the order of the constant affairs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:40.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is thought that the *Hé Tú* and the *Luò Shū* are warp and woof to each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:04:40.417+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Eight Trigrams and the Nine Categories are exterior and interior to each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-3a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:20.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it was also quite different.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-3a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:20.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, collecting Zhòngshū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-3a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:20.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">distinguishing Xiàng and Xīn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-3a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:20.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and recording the deeds presented by the likes of Suī Mèng, Xiàhóu Shèng, Jīng Fáng, Gǔ Yǒng, and Lǐ Xún,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-3a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:20.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">ending with Wáng Mǎng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-3a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:20.202+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">covering twelve generations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:55.681+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and having treacherous schemes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:55.681+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then wood will not be bent and straightened."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-6a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:55.681+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-6a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:55.681+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The explanation says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-6a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:55.681+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-6a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:05:55.681+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the east.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:22.425+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:22.425+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Chūn Qiū*, the sixteenth year of Chéng Gōng, "in the first month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:22.425+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it rained,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:22.425+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the trees iced over."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:22.425+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn thought that the upper *yáng* influence did not flow downwards,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:22.425+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the lower *yīn* influence did not reach upwards,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:56.593+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is a symbol of warfare.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:56.593+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In this year, Jìn had the Battle of Yānlíng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:56.593+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the King of Chǔ was wounded in the eye and defeated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-7a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:56.593+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It also rained frequently.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-8a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:56.593+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:06:56.593+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Zhuàn* (commentary) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-9a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:07:41.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">leadership follows old precedents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-9a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:07:41.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">meritorious achievements are respected and valued,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-9a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:07:41.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and proper distinctions are made between the legitimate and illegitimate heirs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-9a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:07:41.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then fire obtains its nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-9a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:07:41.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If, however, one's belief in the Dao 道 is not firm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-9a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:07:41.905+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">or one flaunts falsehoods,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:09:40.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that the storehouse</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:09:40.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was where the rice pounded by the chief wife and concubines was stored in order to offer it to the ancestral temples.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:09:40.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, the chief wife had licentious conduct</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:09:40.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and harbored rebellious thoughts;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:09:40.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven warned them, saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-10a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:09:40.859+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the chief wife may not offer sacrifices to the ancestral temples.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:15.435+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū 董仲舒 believed that the Lady of Lǔ 魯夫人 was having illicit relations in Qí 齊,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:15.435+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and seven of Duke Huán of Qí's 齊桓 sisters were not married.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:15.435+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The ruler of a state</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:15.435+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the parent of the people;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-11a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:15.435+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">husband and wife</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-11a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:15.435+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are the foundation of life and transformation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-12a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:41.577+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">By sending a heavenly disaster,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-12a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:41.577+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it is thus magnified by calling it the Western Palace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-12a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:41.577+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The "Zuǒ zhuàn" 左氏 commentary believes that the Western Palace</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-12a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:41.577+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the Duke's palace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-12a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:41.577+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Mentioning "West"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-12a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:10:41.577+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">indicates that there is also an East.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:30:20.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:30:20.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third year of Duke Chéng, "on the *jiǎzǐ* day of the second month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:30:20.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the new palace burned."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:30:20.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The "Gǔliáng Commentary" considers it the Xuān Palace;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:30:20.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">not mentioning the posthumous title</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:30:20.309+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is respectful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:08.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the inability to serve the ancestral temple.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:08.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Another explanation is that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:08.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xuān killed the ruler and established himself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-14a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:08.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and should not be ranked among the ancestors.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:08.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:08.66+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the ninth year of Duke Xiāng, "In spring,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:39.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and asked Shì Ruò (士弱), saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:39.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Sòng (宋) experienced a fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:39.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and from this, one knows there is a Mandate of Heaven (tiān dào, 天道).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:39.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Why is that?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:39.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He replied:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:31:39.7+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The ancient fire officials,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:11.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in charge of sacrificing to the Fire Star</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:11.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and implementing fire policies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:11.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the late spring dusk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:11.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">when the Heart Star rises in the east,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:11.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Beak, the Seven Stars, and the bird's head are directly in the south,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:11.311+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then fire is used;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:53.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">天不譴告， and Heaven does not send down warnings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-15a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:53.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">故不可必也。 therefore it cannot be relied upon.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:53.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:53.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">三十年「五月甲午， In the thirtieth year, "in the fifth month, on the day jiǎ-wǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:53.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">宋災」。 there was a fire in Sòng."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:32:53.86+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">董仲舒以為伯姬如宋五年， Dǒng Zhòngshū believed that Bó Jī went to Sòng in the fifth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-17a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:33:39.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and engrave penal law codes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-17a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:33:39.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">to make agreements with the people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-17a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:33:39.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this is called criminal instruments contending for avoidance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-17a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:33:39.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore when the fire star appears,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-17a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:33:39.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">contending for brightness with the fire of the five elements becomes a disaster,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-17a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:33:39.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the symbolic image is thus.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:10.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The commentary says, "Zhèng Bìzào said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:10.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">'In five years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:10.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chén will be re-established,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:10.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and after being established for fifty-two years, it will finally perish.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:10.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zǐchǎn asked the reason for this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:10.169+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and he replied:"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:43.183+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore it is said, "In five years, Chén 陳 will be restored."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:43.183+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The ancestor of Chǔ 楚 was the fire official (火正 *huǒzhèng*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:43.183+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore it is said, "what Chǔ 楚 relies on."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:43.183+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven uses one to generate water,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:43.183+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Earth uses two to generate fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:34:43.183+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven uses three to generate wood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:19.911+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">《坎》為水， *Kǎn* represents water,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:19.911+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">為中男， representing the middle son,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:19.911+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">《離》為火， *Lí* represents fire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:19.911+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">為中女， representing the middle daughter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:19.911+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">蓋取諸此也。 this is probably derived from this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-18a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:19.911+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">自 Dàliáng 四歲而及鶉火， From Dàliáng (state of Wei) four years until it reaches Chúnhuǒ (a star region),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-19a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:52.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">were of the same clan as the Zhōu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-19a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:52.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, King Jǐng of Zhōu was old,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-19a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:52.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Zǐ and Shàn Zǐ served Prince Měng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-19a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:52.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">while the Yǐn clan, the Earl of Shào, and the Earl of Máo served Prince Cháo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-19a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:52.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Prince Cháo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-19a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:35:52.992+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was from Chǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:36:26.743+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he also adopted their wicked theories,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:36:26.743+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">indulging in female entertainers</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:36:26.743+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and dismissing Kǒngzǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:36:26.743+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven's warning seemed to say:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:36:26.743+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Remove those who are high and prominent yet extravagant and excessive."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:36:26.743+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">One said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yòu yòng qí xiéshuō,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yín yú nǚyuè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">ér tuì Kǒngzǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tiānjiè ruò yuē,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">qù gāo xiǎn ér shē jiàn zhě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yī yuē,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">ménquè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">hàolìng suǒ yóu chū yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jīn shě dà shèng ér zòng yǒu zuì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">wáng yǐ chū hàolìng yǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng *Yìzhuàn* yuē:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Jūn bù sī dào,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-20a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jué yāo huǒ shāo gōng."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third year of Duke Āi, "on the *xīnmǎo* day of the fifth month, the Huán and Lí palaces suffered a fire."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Huán, Lí gōng zāi".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū and Liú Xiàng believed that these two palaces should not have been built, as they violated ritual propriety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">wéi lǐ zhě yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Duke Āi, moreover, did not employ Kǒngzǐ because of the Jì family.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When Kǒngzǐ was in Chén and heard of the disaster in Lǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Could it be the Huán and Lí palaces!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He considered Huán to be</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the origin of the Jì family's power,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and Lí</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-21a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was the one who made the Jì family hereditary ministers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fourth year, "on the *xīnchǒu* day of the sixth month, the shrine of Bó suffered a fire."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Bóshè zāi".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū and Liú Xiàng believed that it was the shrine of a destroyed state, and thus served as a warning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">suǒyǐ wéi jiè yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven's warning seemed to say, "The state is about to fall, and no heed is paid to the warning."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">guó jiāng wēiwáng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:37:57.329+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">bùyòng jiè yǐ. Furthermore, he employed his heterodox doctrines, indulged in female music, and dismissed Kǒngzǐ. Heaven's warning seemed to say, "Remove those who are exalted, conspicuous, extravagant, and presumptuous." One such example is the gate tower, from which commands are issued. Now, abandoning the great sage and indulging in those who are guilty, there is no way to issue commands. Jīng Fáng's *Commentary on the Book of Changes* says: "If the ruler does not contemplate the Dao, the strange fire will burn the palace."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:38:51.431+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the shrine of Bó suffered a fire."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:38:51.431+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū and Liú Xiàng believed that it was the shrine of a destroyed state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:38:51.431+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and was therefore a warning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:38:51.431+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven's warning seemed to say,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:38:51.431+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The state will be in peril and decline,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-22a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:38:51.431+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and warnings will not be heeded."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-24a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:22.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">on the day Bǐngzǐ (丙子),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-24a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:22.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the weaving workshop was destroyed by fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-24a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:22.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng (劉向) believed that in the first year, Empress Dowager Lǚ (呂太后) killed the King of Zhào (趙), Rúyì (如意),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-24a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:22.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and cruelly slaughtered his mother, Consort Qī (戚夫人).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-24a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:22.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the tenth month of that year, on the day Rényín (壬寅),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-24a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:22.207+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Empress Dowager installed the daughter of her elder sister, Princess Lǔ Yuán (魯元公主), as Empress.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-25a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:51.726+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-25a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:51.726+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the seventh year of Emperor Wén, on the day guǐ yǒu in the sixth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-25a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:51.726+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the fú sī of the east gate of the Wèiyāng Palace burned down.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-25a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:51.726+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that the east gate was the gate for the feudal lords to pay their respects,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-25a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:51.726+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the fú sī was outside it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-25a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:39:51.726+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizing the feudal lords.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:40:39.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Biàn Diàn (便殿) of the Gāo Garden (高園) caught fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:40:39.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū (董仲舒) replied:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:40:39.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The way of the *Chūnqiū* (春秋) is to use the past to illuminate the future,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:40:39.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore, when there is something in the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:40:39.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">compare it to what is recorded in the *Chūnqiū* that is similar,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:40:39.544+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and subtly and minutely preserve its meaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:10.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Until the fifth month of the third year of Duke Āi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:10.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Huán Palace and Lí Palace were struck by disaster.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:10.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The two served the same purpose,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:10.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and were essentially one,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:10.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">as if to say, 'Burn the noble and remove injustice.'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:10.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Duke Āi was unable to see this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:39.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the past, Qín received the failings of the collapsed Zhōu</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:39.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but failed to transform them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:39.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hàn received the failings of the collapsed Qín</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:39.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but also failed to transform them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:39.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Having succeeded two sets of failings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:41:39.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and inheriting their downstream effects,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:42:25.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">let alone the feudal lords!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.90" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:42:25.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Those who are improper within the court,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.91" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:42:25.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">even if as noble as the Gāo Garden Palace,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.92" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:42:25.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are still burned and afflicted by disaster,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.93" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:42:25.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">let alone the great ministers!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-27a.94" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:42:25.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is the will of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-28a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:08.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">using the principles of the *Chūnqiū* to make independent decisions externally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-28a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:08.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">without seeking permission.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-28a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:08.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">After he returned and reported the matter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-28a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:08.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the emperor approved of everything.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-29a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:08.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-29a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:08.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first year of Tàichū (104 BCE), the eleventh month, Yǐyǒu day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:33.746+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">resulting in tens of thousands of deaths.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:33.746+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The crown prince was defeated and fled,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:33.746+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">committing suicide at Lake Hú.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:33.746+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The following year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:33.746+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qūlí was also implicated for cursing and was to be beheaded;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:43:33.746+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">his wife was publicly executed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:04.51+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The next year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:04.51+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Governor of the Capital District (Jīngzhào Yǐn), Wáng Zhāng, defended Shāng's loyalty and integrity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:04.51+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">saying that Fèng monopolized power.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:04.51+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Fèng falsely accused Zhāng of the crime of high treason,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:04.51+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he was imprisoned and died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-30a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:04.51+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and his wife and children were exiled to Hé Pǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:29.604+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:29.604+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fourth year of Yuánfèng, fifth month, day Dīngchǒu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:29.604+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the main hall of the temple of Emperor Xiàowén burned down.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:29.604+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that Emperor Xiàowén</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:29.604+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was a ruler of the line of the great ancestor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:29.604+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and it had the same significance as the fire at the Xuān Xie of the Chéng Zhou dynasty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:59.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and since the emperor had already come of age but did not return the government to him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:59.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he would become a harm to the country.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:59.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, the coming-of-age ceremony was in the first month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:59.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and in the fifth month, the disaster appeared.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:59.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Ancient temples were all within the city,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-32a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:44:59.296+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but the Xiàowén Temple was the first to be located outside.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-33a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:28.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was inappropriate for a place of imperial tombs and ancestral tablets.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-33a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:28.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven's warning seemed to say,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-33a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:28.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Remove those honored, close, pleasure-seeking, and improperly behaving officials,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-33a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:28.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">who will harm loyal and good people."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-33a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:28.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, Zhāng (章) was impeached for racing horses and galloping down the firebreak of the Shanglin (上林) Park,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-33a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:28.223+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and was dismissed from his position.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-34a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:54.621+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and he spoke about matters through Xiǎn's (顯) words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-34a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:54.621+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">with decisions being made through Xiǎn's (顯) mouth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-34a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:54.621+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Kān (堪) became ill and unable to speak.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-34a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:54.621+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xiǎn (顯) falsely accused Zhāng Mèng (張猛),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-34a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:54.621+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">who committed suicide at the Gōngchē (公車).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-34a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:45:54.621+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When Emperor Chéng (成) ascended the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-37a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:46:20.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">On the day wǔwǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-37a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:46:20.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the South Gate of the garden of the Lì Empress burned down.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-37a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:46:20.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At this time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-37a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:46:20.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Fēiyàn enjoyed great favor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-37a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:46:20.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Empress Xǔ having been deposed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-37a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:46:20.963+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the emperor was about to establish her (as empress).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-38a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:02.086+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the sixth month, jiǎ wǔ (甲午),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-38a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:02.086+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the southern side of the eastern gate of Emperor Xiào Wén's (孝文) Bà líng (霸陵) tomb caught fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-38a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:02.086+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Cháng lè (長樂) Palace</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-38a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:02.086+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was where Emperor Chéng's (成帝) mother, Empress Dowager Wáng (王太后), resided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-38a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:02.086+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wèi yāng (未央) Palace</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-38a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:02.086+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was where the emperor resided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-39a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:27.1+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">believing it was not permissible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-39a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:27.1+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Grand Empress Dowager had them all removed from their official positions and titles,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-39a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:27.1+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and then claimed the title of honor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-39a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:27.1+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Three years later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-39a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:27.1+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Emperor died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-39a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:27.1+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Fù clan was exterminated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-41a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:55.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">decorates terraces and pavilions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-41a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:55.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">engages in internal licentiousness and disorder,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-41a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:55.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">violates one's relatives,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-41a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:55.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and insults one's father and elder brothers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-41a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:55.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then the crops will not grow."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-42a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:47:55.878+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-42a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:24.338+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Disasters of drought and flood will occur, and grasses, trees, and the hundred grains will not ripen;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-42a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:24.338+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this is what is meant by "planting and harvesting will not succeed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-43a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:24.338+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-43a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:24.338+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the 28th year of Duke Yán, "in winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-43a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:24.338+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was a great ▸(flood)◂ [fn:: The Jǐngyòu edition does not have the character "flood," and neither does the *Chūnqiū Jīng*. The note is the same.] disaster, and wheat and grain were lost."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-43a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:24.338+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū believed that it was because Lady Āi Jiāng was lewd and immoral,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-44a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:57.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and encroaches upon the borders,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-44a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:57.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then metal will not follow leather."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:57.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:57.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The explanation says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:57.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Metal</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:48:57.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">represents the west.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:21.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and does not value the lives of the people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:21.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then Metal loses its nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:21.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">For when craftsmen smelt and cast metal and iron,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:21.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the metal and iron become frozen, stagnant, dried up, and hard,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:21.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and many fail;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-45a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:21.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and as for becoming strange anomalies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-46a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:46.477+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">losing its nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-46a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:46.477+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng (劉向) believed that the color white was dominant in stone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-46a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:46.477+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">belonging to the white auspicious signs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-47a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:46.477+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-47a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:46.477+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third year of the Hóngjiā (鴻嘉) reign period of Emperor Chéng (Chéng Dì), in the fifth month, on the day yǐhài (乙亥),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-47a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:49:46.477+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a large stone on Jìnán Mountain (冀南山) in Tiānshuǐ (天水) emitted sound.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-47a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:17.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Four years later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-47a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:17.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Fán Bìng 樊並 of Wèishì 尉氏 and others plotted a rebellion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-47a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:17.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">killing Yán Pǔ 嚴普, the Grand Administrator of Chénliú 陳留,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-47a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:17.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and calling themselves generals.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-47a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:17.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Sū Lìng 蘇令 and other fugitives from Shānyáng 山陽, with several hundred followers, stole weapons from the armory,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-47a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:17.46+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">passing through more than forty commanderies and kingdoms,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-48a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:47.424+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">goes against the seasons of Heaven,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-48a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:47.424+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then water will not flow downwards."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:47.424+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:47.424+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The explanation says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:47.424+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Water</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:50:47.424+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the North.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:51:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then Yin and Yang will be harmonized, and the beginning and end will be complete.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:51:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In this way, water obtains its nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:51:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If one does not respect ghosts and gods,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:51:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and issues commands against the seasons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:51:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then water loses its nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:51:15.367+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Mists and waters will erupt violently.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:10.276+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shārén. and kills people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:10.276+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhuī zhū bù jiě, Pursuing execution without resolving it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:10.276+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">zī wèi bù lǐ, is called not being reasonable,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:10.276+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jué shuǐ wǔgǔ bù shōu. the resulting water causes the five grains not to be harvested.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:10.276+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dàbài bù jiě, Great defeat without resolving it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:10.276+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">zī wèi jiē yīn. is called all yin.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Killing people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Pursuing and executing relentlessly</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, this is called a lack of governance</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, and then the waters and the five grains will not be harvested.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Defeating greatly and not resolving</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, this is called all *yīn*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">To resolve</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">means to pardon.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When a king suffers a great defeat</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, he executes the chief perpetrator</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and pardons the masses</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">; otherwise, all will be filled with *yīn qì*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, and then the waters will flow into the towns</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-49a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, and falling frost will kill *shūcǎo*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first year of Duke Huán</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, "In autumn, there was a great flood."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū and Liú Xiàng believed that Duke Huán murdered his elder brother, Duke Yǐn</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, and the people and ministers grieved for Yǐn and despised Huán.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, Sòng Dū murdered his lord</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, and the feudal lords convened</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, intending to punish him</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, but Huán received bribes from Sòng and returned</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, and again turned against Sòng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The feudal lords therefore attacked Lǔ</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, and continued to engage in warfare and form enmities</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, with corpses lying and blood flowing</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, and the people became more resentful</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, hence in the summer of the thirteenth year there was again a great flood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Another explanation is that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Lady was arrogant and licentious</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, plotting to murder the lord</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, and the *yīn qì* was flourishing</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:52:25.126+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, but Huán did not realize it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:53:21.13+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, in the summer of the thirteenth year, there was another great flood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:53:21.13+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is also said that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:53:21.13+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the lady was arrogant and licentious,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:53:21.13+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">plotting to murder the ruler.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:53:21.13+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Yīn Qì was flourishing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-50a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:53:21.13+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but Huán did not realize it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-52a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:04.694+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the yin energy was strong,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-52a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:04.694+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore both countries experienced floods.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-52a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:04.694+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that at that time, Lord Mǐn of Sòng was arrogant and disrespectful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-52a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:04.694+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and did not change his ways despite seeing disasters,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-52a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:04.694+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the next year he gambled with his minister Sòng Wàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-52a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:04.694+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">with women at his side,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-54a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:39.797+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and this was also seen as retribution,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-54a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:39.797+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">with military conflicts and feuds interconnected,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-54a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:39.797+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">causing the common people to be worried and resentful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-54a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:39.797+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that Duke Xuān killed his son Chì and enthroned himself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-54a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:39.797+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">son Chì</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-54a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:54:39.797+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was from Qí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-56a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:07.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The state was small and its army weak,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-56a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:07.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">constantly opposing powerful enemies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-56a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:07.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the common people were worried and resentful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-56a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:07.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Yīn 陰 energy was strong.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-56a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:07.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 believed that prior to this, Xiāng Gōng 襄公 was disrespectful to neighboring states,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-56a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:07.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore Zhū 邾 attacked its south.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-58a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:36.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-58a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:36.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the autumn of the third year of Emperor Wén 文,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-58a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:36.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was heavy rain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-58a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:36.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">continuous day and night for thirty-five days.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-58a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:36.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Mountain floods erupted in Lántián 藍田,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-58a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:55:36.224+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">displacing over nine hundred families.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-59a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:31.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fifth year of the Yuán Dì 元帝's Yǒng Guāng 永光 reign, in summer and autumn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-59a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:31.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was a great flood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-59a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:31.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In Yǐng Chuān 颍川, Rǔ Nán 汝南, Huái Yáng 淮阳, and Lú Jiāng 庐江 there was rain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-59a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:31.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">destroying villages and people's homes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-59a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:31.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the floodwaters killed people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-59a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:31.366+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The year before, the officials requested to abolish the temples in the commanderies and kingdoms.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:56.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">first is appearance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:56.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">second is speech,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:56.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">third is sight,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:56.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">fourth is hearing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:56.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">fifth is thought.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:57:56.275+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Appearance is called respect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:18.803+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">constant rain arrives as if in accordance;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:18.803+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">with presumption (*jiàn*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:18.803+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">constant sunshine arrives as if in accordance;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:18.803+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">with laxity (*shū*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:18.803+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">constant warmth arrives as if in accordance;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-61a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:18.803+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">with haste,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-63a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:50.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*Niè* is like a sprouting tooth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-63a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:50.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">As for the six domestic animals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-63a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:50.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">they are called *huò* (禍),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-63a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:50.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">meaning they are obvious.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-63a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:50.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">As for humans,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-63a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:58:50.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">they are called *ē* (痾).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:59:18.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">all of whom used it to teach their worthy disciples.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:59:18.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Their transmission was the same as Liú Xiàng's (劉向),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:59:18.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">only Liú Xīn's (劉歆) transmission was uniquely different.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:59:18.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When outward appearance lacks respect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:59:18.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it is called "not solemn" (*bù sù* 不肅).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T21:59:18.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*Sù* (肅),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:00:42.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then there will be frivolous and strange clothing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:00:42.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore there are clothing anomalies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:00:42.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Water is associated with movement,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:00:42.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore there are turtle prodigies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:00:42.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the "Book of Changes",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:00:42.397+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Xùn" represents the chicken,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:10.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*Kǎn* is in the north,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:10.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">representing winter and water.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:10.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Spring and autumn</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:10.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are when day and night are equal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:10.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and cold and heat are balanced,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:10.078+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore the Qi of metal and wood easily transform into each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.91" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:34.364+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This explanation is incorrect.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.92" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:34.364+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In spring and autumn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.93" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:34.364+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the energies of *yīn* and *yáng* are equally matched,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.94" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:34.364+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">wood is sick and metal is flourishing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:34.364+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore they can combine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-64a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:34.364+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">only in this one instance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:01:50.182+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and told the Duke,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:15.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">his eyes are not on his body,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:15.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and his feet do not follow his eyes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:15.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">his heart must be different.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:15.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If the eyes and body do not follow each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:15.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how can he last long?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:15.5+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">To assemble the lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:49.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn Hóu was discordant in two ways,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:49.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">that is why I said this."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:49.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Two years later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:49.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the people of Jìn killed Lì Gōng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:49.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">All of this sort</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-65a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:02:49.498+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">can be said to be the fault of disrespectful appearance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:29.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but was indolent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:29.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Guò returned and reported to the king, saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:29.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The lord of Jìn will probably have no descendants!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:29.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The king bestowed an order upon him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:29.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but he was indolent in receiving the auspicious symbol,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:29.122+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he has already abandoned himself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Duò. (Negligence/Sloth)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Guò Guī returned and reported to the king, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Jìn Hóu (晉侯), will he have no descendants?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The king bestowed upon him a mandate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but he was negligent in receiving the auspicious token.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He has already abandoned himself;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">what will he have to continue the lineage with?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Ritual propriety (lǐ)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the framework of a state;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">reverence (jìng)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the carriage that carries ritual propriety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Without reverence, ritual propriety cannot be practiced;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">if ritual propriety cannot be practiced, then superiors and inferiors become confused.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">How can the dynasty last long?!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twenty-first year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn Huì Gōng (晉惠公) died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and his son, Huái Gōng (懷公), was enthroned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The people of Jìn (晉) killed him</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-67a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and installed Wén Gōng (文公) instead.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the thirteenth year of Chéng Gōng (成公),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the ruler of Jìn (晉) sent Xì Qí (郤錡) to request troops from Lǔ (魯).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He was irreverent in conducting the affair.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Mèng Xiànzǐ (孟獻子) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The Xì (郤) clan will likely perish!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Ritual propriety (lǐ)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the framework of a person;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">reverence (jìng)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the foundation of a person.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xì Zǐ (郤子) has no foundation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Moreover, as the successor of the former ruler's high minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he received the mandate to seek troops;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he should be protecting the state and its altars;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:03:39.315+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yet he negligently disregards the ruler's command."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:11.393+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the foundation of a person.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:11.393+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xì Zǐ (郤子) has no foundation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:11.393+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Moreover, he is the successor of the late ruler's chief minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:11.393+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He received a charge to seek aid;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:11.393+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he should be protecting the altars of the state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-68a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:11.393+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yet he is lax and abandons the ruler's command."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-69a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:44.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and earnestness lies in guarding one's profession.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-69a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:44.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The great affairs of the state</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-69a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:44.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">lie in sacrifices and warfare.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-69a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:44.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Sacrifices have the distribution of sacrificial meat,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-69a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:44.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and warfare has the receiving of *zhèn* 脤;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-69a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:04:44.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">these are great matters of the spirits.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-70a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:18.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Kǔ Chéng jiā wáng. the Kǔ Chéng family perished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-71a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:18.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-71a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:18.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xiāng Gōng qī nián, In the seventh year of Duke Xiāng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-71a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:18.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wèi Sūn Wénzi p聘 yú Lǔ, Sūn Wénzi of Wèi paid a visit to Lǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-71a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:18.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jūn dēng yì dēng. and the lord ascended (the dais), and he also ascended.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-71a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:18.848+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shū Sūn Mùzi xiāng, Shū Sūn Mùzi assisted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-72a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:56.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The lord of Cài will probably not escape misfortune!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-72a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:56.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The day he passed by here,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-72a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:56.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the lord sent Zǐ Zhǎn to greet him at the east gate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-72a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:56.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and he was arrogant.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-72a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:56.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">I said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-72a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:05:56.269+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">'He will still change it.'"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-73a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:06:25.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">People who are immoderate</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-73a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:06:25.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">rarely do not cause trouble.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-73a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:06:25.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If he is indeed installed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-73a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:06:25.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he will surely bring sorrow to the Jì (季) family."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-73a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:06:25.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wǔzǐ (武子) did not listen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-73a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:06:25.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and ultimately installed him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:13.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The commander lacks deportment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:13.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the people have no standard to follow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:13.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When the people have no standard to follow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:13.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yet he is above the people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:13.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he cannot last."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:13.485+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If the chief minister has no dignified bearing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the people will have nothing to emulate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If the people have nothing to emulate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he who is above the people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-74a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cannot last long."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the summer of the eleventh year of Duke Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhōu Dān Zǐ held a meeting in Qī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and when he looked at his subordinates, he spoke slowly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn Shū Xiàng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Dān Zǐ will probably die!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The court has prescribed positions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">meetings have markers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">clothes have hems,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">belts have knots.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At meetings and court audiences, speeches must be heard from the positions of the markers and prescribed positions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in order to display the order of affairs;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the gaze should not go beyond the center of the knots and hems,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in order to guide the countenance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Words are used to command them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the countenance is used to make them clear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">if there is a failure, there will be a defect.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Now Dān Zǐ is the chief of the royal officials,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and commands affairs at the meeting,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but his gaze does not reach his belt,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">his words do not exceed his steps,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">his countenance does not guide his appearance, and his words are not clear.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Not guiding is not respectful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">not clear is not obedient,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he has no vital energy to guard."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twelfth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dān Chéng Gōng died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-76a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-76a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:25.98+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third month of the twenty-first year of Duke Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:59.286+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">without clarity, there is no following;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:59.286+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he has no ability to safeguard his position."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:59.286+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twelfth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-75a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:59.286+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dān Chéng Gōng died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-76a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:59.286+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-76a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:07:59.286+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third month of the twenty-first year of Duke Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-77a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:25.816+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is not right.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-77a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:25.816+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">To violate righteousness in a great matter</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-77a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:25.816+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">will surely bring great calamity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-77a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:25.816+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Even if Jìn does not lose the lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-77a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:25.816+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wèi Zǐ will probably not avoid a change of countenance!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-77a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:25.816+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At this undertaking,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-78a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:56.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">both are without measure;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-78a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:56.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">their hearts are already lost.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-78a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:56.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If even auspicious events lack embodiment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-78a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:56.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how can they last long?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-78a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:08:56.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Holding the head high is arrogance;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:26.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the time when thunder and lightning begin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:26.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it should rain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:26.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but not a heavy rain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:26.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heavy rain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:26.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is a punishment for frequent rain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:26.323+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Within eight days of the first thunder and lightning, there was heavy snow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:54.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">develops and promotes the hidden and latent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:54.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">proclaims and exalts the virtue of flourishing yang.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:54.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Entering can remove harm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:54.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">emerging can create benefit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:54.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it is an image of the ruler.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-80a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:09:54.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At this time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-81a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:10:23.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">lasting from the seventh month to the tenth month.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-81a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:10:23.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the autumn of the third year of Emperor Chéng's Jiànshǐ reign (30 BC),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-81a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:10:23.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there were over thirty days of heavy rain;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-81a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:10:23.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in the fourth year (29 BC), in the ninth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-81a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:10:23.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there were over ten days of heavy rain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-82a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:10:23.832+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-82a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:01.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">means the abandonment of his inner feelings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-82a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:01.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Using clothing to estrange him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-82a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:01.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and timing to seal the matter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-82a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:01.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the mottled and cool autumn and winter kill;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-82a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:01.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the gold is cold, and the *jué* (玦) indicates separation;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-82a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:01.113+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how can one rely on this!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:31.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yī yuē, One interpretation is,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:31.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">fēi dú wèi Zǐ Zāng zhī shēn, it was not solely for Zǐ Zāng's person,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:31.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yì Wén Gōng zhī jiè yě. but also a warning to Duke Wén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:31.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">chū, Initially,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:31.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wén Gōng bù lǐ Jìn Wén, Duke Wén was discourteous to Duke Wén of Jìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:31.941+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yòu fàn tiānzǐ mìng ér fá Huá, and also violated the Son of Heaven's command by attacking Huá,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">First,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it's not only about the personal conduct of Zǐ Zāng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but also a warning from Duke Wén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Initially,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Duke Wén was disrespectful to Jìn Wén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and also disobeyed the Son of Heaven's decree by attacking Huá,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">showing disrespect and a lack of reverence for his superiors.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, Jìn Wén attacked Zhèng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-83a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">almost causing its destruction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">During the time of Emperor Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hè, the King of Chāngyì, sent a senior grand master to Cháng'ān,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">who made many slanted-brimmed hats</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">to bestow upon high officials,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and also gave them to servants.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng considered this to be akin to strange omens in clothing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At the time, King Hè was reckless and unruly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and upon hearing that the Emperor was unwell,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he continued hunting and racing as usual,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">associating and frolicking with grooms and stewards,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">acting arrogant and disrespectful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hats are honorable attire,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">while servants are lowly people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hè, without cause, favored making extraordinary hats,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which foreshadowed his downfall from nobility.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Giving hats to servants</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">signifies falling from the most exalted to the most base.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Afterward, the Emperor died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">without an heir,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">so the high officials of the Hàn summoned Hè to be his successor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">After ascending the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he was mad and wicked,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">binding and executing counselors like Xiàhóu Shèng and others.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:11:54.943+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Thereupon, the high officials informed the Empress Dowager,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:41.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">without an heir,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:41.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the high ministers of Hàn (漢) summoned Hè (賀) to be the successor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:41.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Upon ascending the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:41.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he was wildly chaotic and immoral,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:41.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">binding and executing advisors like Xiàhóu Shèng (夏侯勝) and others.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:41.576+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Thereupon the high ministers reported to the Empress Dowager,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He had no sons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Hàn 漢 court officials summoned Hè 賀 to be his successor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Upon ascending the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he was mad and without principle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">tying up and killing remonstrators such as Xiàhóu Shèng 夏侯勝 and others.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Thereupon, the high officials informed the Empress Dowager,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and deposed Hè 賀, making him a commoner.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When Hè 賀 was king,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he saw a large white dog wearing a *fāngshān* 方山 hat, but without a tail.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This was a costume apparition,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and also a canine disaster.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hè 賀 asked the court physician Gōng Suì 龔遂 about it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Suì 遂 said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"This is a heavenly warning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">saying that those close to the throne will all be wearing dog hats.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Remove them and you will survive;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">if you do not remove them, you will perish."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">After Hè 賀 had been deposed for several years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Emperor Xuān 宣 enfeoffed him as a marquess.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He again committed crimes</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and died without being able to establish an heir,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which was another effect of the canine disaster without a tail.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's 京房 *Book of Changes Commentary* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When conduct is not in accordance with the proper way,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the blame is that slaves wear hats,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the world is in chaos,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the ruler has no proper successor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and concubines' sons pay homage."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It also says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When the ruler is not upright,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">ministers desire to usurp,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the costume apparition of a dog wearing a hat appears at the gate of the court."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:12:49.534+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">During the *Hóngjiā* 鴻嘉 and *Yǒngshǐ* 永始 eras of Emperor Chéng 成,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:23.937+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It also says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:23.937+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When the ruler is not upright,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:23.937+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">ministers will want to usurp [power].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-84a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:23.937+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The anomaly will be that dogs wearing hats come out of the palace gates."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:23.937+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:23.937+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">During the Hóngjiā (鴻嘉) and Yǒngshǐ (永始) periods of Emperor Chéng (成),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:54.014+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cherishes and gathers insignificant people with no sense of righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:54.014+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">treating them as private guests;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:54.014+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">establishes private fields among the common people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:54.014+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and keeps private slaves and carriages in the Běigōng (North Palace);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:54.014+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">frequently abandoning the dignity of facing south,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-85a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:13:54.014+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">leaving the security of the deep palace,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-86a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:14:32.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the king and Bīn Qǐ (賓起) secretly planned to establish him (as heir).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-86a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:14:32.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">They hunted in the Běishān (北山, North Mountain),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-86a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:14:32.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">intending to use the troops to kill the partisans of the legitimate heir,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-86a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:14:32.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but before they could, the king died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-86a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:14:32.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The three sons contended for the state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-86a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:14:32.68+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the royal house was thrown into great disorder.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:19.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and feared that this would apply to him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:19.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng thought that Fáng had misinterpreted the chicken omen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:19.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The rooster is a minor domestic animal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:19.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in charge of the time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:19.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the rising and resting of men,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:19.446+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it is an image of minor officials managing affairs and governing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:48.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wáng Jìn nǚ yě. was the daughter of Wáng Jìn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:48.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Huánglóng yuánnián, In the first year of Huánglóng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:48.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xuān shì bēng, Lord Xuān passed away,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:48.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">tàizǐ lì, the Crown Prince was enthroned,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:48.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shì wèi Yuándì. and became Emperor Yuán.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:15:48.589+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wáng fēi jiāng wèi huánghòu, Consort Wáng was about to become Empress,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:16.56+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Marquis of Yangping (陽平頃侯 Yángpíng Qīng Hóu), Jìn (禁), died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:16.56+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">His son, Fèng (鳳), inherited the marquisate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:16.56+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and became an Attendant and Commandant of the Guards (侍中衛尉 Shìzhōng Wèi Wèi).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:16.56+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Emperor Yuan (元帝 Yuán Dì) died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:16.56+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Crown Prince ascended the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:16.56+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">becoming Emperor Cheng (成帝 Chéng Dì).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:47.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the ruler is isolated."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:47.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It also says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:47.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When women dominate the government,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:47.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the country is not at peace;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:47.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">when a hen crows like a rooster,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-87a.106" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:16:47.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the ruler is not honored."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:19.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and a field mouse is even smaller than that.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:19.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">An ox</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:19.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is a large domestic animal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:19.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a revered object for sacrificing to Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:19.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Horns</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:19.347+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are symbols of warfare,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xī (鼷) is the smallest of the rats.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The ox,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is a large domestic animal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and a revered object for sacrifices to Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The horn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizes weaponry,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and being on top,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">represents the sovereign's authority.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The tiny xīshǔ (鼷鼠),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">eats the horn of the supreme ox,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizing the Jìshì (季氏), merely a subject, acting as thieves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">attempting to seize national power, injure the sovereign's authority, and harm the sacrifices to Zhōu Gōng (周公).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Even changing to an ox for divination,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the xīshǔ (鼷鼠) still eats its horn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven is repeating its warning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Duke Chéng (成公) was lazy, negligent, and muddled,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">resulting in both ruler and ministers being held captive by Jìn (晉).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">By the time of Duke Xiāng (襄公),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn (晉) held the meeting at Xiùliáng (溴梁),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and all the great officers of the empire usurped the ruler's authority.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, the Three Families banished Duke Zhāo (昭公),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">who eventually died abroad,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">almost severing the sacrifices to Zhōu Gōng (周公).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū (董仲舒) believed that the xīshǔ (鼷鼠) eating the suburban ox</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was due to negligence in raising the sacrificial animals.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's (京房) *Yì Zhuàn* (易傳) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"If sacrifices to Heaven are not performed carefully,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-88a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the portent will be xīshǔ (鼷鼠) gnawing on the horns of the suburban ox."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fifteenth year of Duke Dìng (定公), "In the first month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a xīshǔ (鼷鼠) ate the suburban ox,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the ox died."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng (劉向) believed that Duke Dìng (定公) knew that the Jìshì's (季氏) banishment of Duke Zhāo (昭公)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:17:32.142+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was a crime as terrible as that.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:06.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:06.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dìng Gōng shíwǔ nián "zhēng yuè, In the fifteenth year of Duke Dìng, in the first month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:06.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xī shǔ shí jiāo niú, *xi* rats ate the suburban ox,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:06.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">niú sǐ". and the ox died."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:06.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng yǐwéi Dìng Gōng zhī Jì Shì zhú Zhāo Gōng, Liú Xiàng believed that Duke Dìng knew that the Jì Shì clan had driven out Duke Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-89a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:06.523+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">zuì è rú bǐ, and their crimes were like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-90a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:40.441+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Duke Āi (哀公) was young</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-90a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:40.441+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and did not personally witness the affairs of Duke Zhāo (昭公),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-90a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:40.441+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore, he saw omens of defeat and destruction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-90a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:40.441+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Consequently, Āi (哀公) did not awaken,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-90a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:40.441+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and fled to Yuè (粵),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-90a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:18:40.441+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this was the result.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:12.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, ministers in discussion believed that there was fear of a water disaster.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:12.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Rats</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:12.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are small thieving creatures</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:12.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">that come out at night and hide during the day;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:12.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">now, they leave their burrows during the day and climb trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:12.561+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizing that lowly people will occupy prominent and noble positions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shí yì chén yǐ wéi kǒng yǒu shuǐzāi. At that time, the ministers discussed and thought there might be a flood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dàoqiè xiǎochóng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yè chū zhòu nì;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jīn zhòu qù xué ér dēng mù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xiàng jiànrén jiāng jū xiǎnguì zhī wèi yě. Rats, being petty thieving creatures, come out at night and hide during the day; now, going out of their holes during the day and climbing trees, is an omen of base people about to occupy positions of high rank and nobility.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tóngbǎi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wèi Sī Hòu yuán suǒzài yě. Tóngbǎi was the location of the garden of Empress Wèi Sī.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qí hòu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào huánghòu zì wēijiàn dēng zhì zūn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ Wèi Hòu tónglèi. Afterwards, Empress Zhào rose from a humble and lowly state to the highest position of honor, being of the same kind as Empress Wèi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Hòu zhōng wú zǐ ér wéi hài. Empress Zhào ultimately had no sons and brought harm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Míngnián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǒu yuān fén cháo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shā zǐ zhī yì yě. The next year, there were kites burning their nests, a strange omen of killing their young.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tiānxiàng réng jiàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shèn kěwèi yě. The celestial signs were still visible, and were deeply frightening.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shí yì chén yǐwéi kǒng yǒu shuǐzāi. The ministers of the time thought that there might be a flood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yī yuē,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shǔ, Mice,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiē Wáng Mǎng qiè wèi zhī xiàng yún. One interpretation is that all of these were omens of Wáng Mǎng usurping the throne, it is said.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dàoqiè xiǎo chóng, are thieving little creatures,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng "Yì Zhuàn" yuē:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yè chū zhòu nì; coming out at night and hiding during the day;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Chén sī lù wǎng pì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jīn zhòu qù xué ér dēng mù, now they leave their holes during the day and climb trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jué yāo shǔ cháo." Jīng Fáng's "Commentary on the Book of Changes" says: "When ministers privately amass wealth without restraint, the prodigy is that rats nest."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xiàng jiànrén jiāng jū xiǎnguì zhī wèi yě. symbolizing lowly people about to occupy positions of prominence and nobility.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tóngbǎi, Tóngbǎi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wèi Sī hòu yuán suǒzài yě. was the location of Empress Wèi Sī's garden.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wén Gōng shísān nián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qí hòu, Afterwards,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Dà Shì wū huài".</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào huánghòu zì wēijiàn dēng zhì zūn, Empress Zhào ascended to the highest position from a humble background,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn jīn lì mù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">mù dòng yě. In the thirteenth year of Duke Wén, "the roof of the Great Chamber collapsed". Metal near wood injures the wood, the wood is moved.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ Wèi hòu tónglèi. similar to Empress Wèi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào hòu zhōng wú zǐ ér wéi hài. Empress Zhào ultimately had no son and caused harm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xiān shì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Míngnián, The next year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Lí Gōng hōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǒu yuān fén cháo, there was a kite that burned its nest,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shā zǐ zhī yì yě. an omen of killing offspring.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shílìu yuè nǎi zuò zhǔ. Before this, in winter, Duke Lí passed away, and it was only in the sixteenth month that his spirit tablet was made.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tiānxiàng réng jiàn, Heavenly omens continued to appear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hòu liù yuè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shén kěwèi yě. which were truly frightening.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yòu jí dì yú Tàimiào ér zhì Lí Gōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:26.27+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Chūnqiū" jī zhī. Six months later, they again auspiciously offered a dì sacrifice at the Grand Temple and installed Duke Lí's spirit tablet, which the "Spring and Autumn Annals" criticized.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yī yuē, One interpretation is,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiē Wáng Mǎng qiè wèi zhī xiàng yún. that these were all omens of Wáng Mǎng usurping the throne.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng "Yì Zhuàn" yuē: Jīng Fáng's "Commentary on the Book of Changes" says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Chén sī lù wǎng pì, "When ministers selfishly monopolize emoluments and ignore prohibitions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jué yāo shǔ cháo." the anomaly is rats nesting."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wén gōng shísān nián, In the thirteenth year of Duke Wén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Dàshì wū huài". "the roof of the Great Chamber collapsed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn jīn lì mù, Nearby, metal attacks wood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">mù dòng yě. and the wood moves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xiān shì, Before this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dōng, in winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Lí gōng hōng, Duke Lí died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shíliù yuè nǎi zuò zhǔ. and it was only in the sixteenth month that his spirit tablet was made.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hòu liù yuè, Six months later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yòu jí dì yú tàimiào ér zhì Lí gōng, another auspicious Di sacrifice was performed at the Grand Temple, with Duke Lí being promoted to be associated with it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:19:36.225+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Chūnqiū" jī zhī. The *Spring and Autumn Annals* criticized this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shí yì chén yǐ wéi kǒng yǒu shuǐzāi. The commentators of the time believed this portended a flood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dàoqiè xiǎo chóng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yè chū zhòu nì;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jīn zhòu qù xué ér dēng mù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xiàng jiàn rén jiāng jū xiǎnguì zhī wèi yě. Rats are small, thieving creatures that come out at night and hide during the day. Now, they are leaving their holes during the day to climb trees, which symbolizes that lowly people will occupy positions of high rank and nobility.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tóngbǎi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wèi Sī Hòu yuán suǒzài yě. Tóngbǎi was the location of Empress Wèi Sī's garden.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qí hòu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào huánghòu zì wēijiàn dēng zhì zūn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ Wèi hòu tónglèi. Later, Empress Zhào rose from a humble and lowly status to the highest position, similar to Empress Wèi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào hòu zhōng wú zǐ ér wéi hài. Empress Zhào ultimately had no children and became a source of harm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Míngnián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǒu yuān fén cháo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shā zǐ zhī yì yě. The following year, there was a kite that burned its nest, a strange occurrence of killing its own offspring.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tiānxiàng réng jiàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shén kěwèi yě. These celestial omens were still visible, which was very frightening.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yī yuē,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiē Wáng Mǎng qiè wèi zhī xiàng yún. One account says that these were all omens of Wáng Mǎng usurping the throne.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng “Yì Zhuàn” yuē:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">“Chén sī lù wǎng pì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jué yāo shǔ cháo.” Jīng Fáng's "Commentary on the Book of Changes" states: "When officials privately amass wealth and disregard the law, the strange occurrence of rats nesting will occur."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wén Gōng shísān nián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">“dà shì wū huài”. In the thirteenth year of Duke Wén, "the roof of the great hall collapsed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn jīn lì mù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">mù dòng yě. Metal overcoming wood means the wood is in motion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xiān shì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Lí Gōng hōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shíliù yuè nǎi zuò zhǔ. Before this, in winter, Duke Lí passed away, and it was only in the sixteenth month that his spirit tablet was made.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hòu liù yuè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yòu jí dì yú tài miào ér zhì Lí Gōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:21:21.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">“Chūnqiū” jī zhī. Six months later, they again auspiciously performed the *dì* sacrifice in the Great Temple and enshrined Duke Lí, which the "Spring and Autumn Annals" criticized.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shí yì chén yǐwéi kǒng yǒu shuǐzāi. At that time, officials debated, thinking there might be a flood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dàoqiè xiǎo chóng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yè chū zhòu nì; Rats are small, thieving creatures that come out at night and hide during the day.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīn zhòu qù xué ér dēng mù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xiàng jiàn rén jiāng jū xiǎnguì zhī wèi yě. Now, they leave their holes during the day and climb trees, symbolizing lowly people about to occupy positions of prominence and nobility.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tóngbǎi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wèi Sī Hòu yuán suǒzài yě. Tóngbǎi was the location of Empress Wèi Sī's garden.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qí hòu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Huánghòu zì wēijiàn dēng zhì zūn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ Wèi Hòu tónglèi. Later, Empress Zhào rose from a humble background to the supreme position, similar to Empress Wèi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Hòu zhōng wú zǐ ér wéi hài. Empress Zhào ultimately had no children and caused harm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Míngnián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǒu yuān fén cháo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shā zǐ zhī yì yě. The following year, there was a kite that burned its nest, a strange event of killing its own offspring.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tiānxiàng réng jiàn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shén kěwèi yě. These omens were still seen and were truly frightening.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yī yuē,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiē Wáng Mǎng qiè wèi zhī xiàng yún. It is said that these were all omens of Wáng Mǎng usurping the throne.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng *Yìzhuàn* yuē:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Chén sī lù wǎng pì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jué yāo shǔ cháo." Jīng Fáng's *Commentary on the Book of Changes* says: "When officials privately hoard wealth without restraint, the strange omen is rats nesting."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wén Gōng shísān nián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Dàshì wū huài". In the thirteenth year of Duke Wén, "the roof of the Great Chamber collapsed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn jīn lì mù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">mù dòng yě. Metal close by harms wood; the wood moves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xiānshì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Lí Gōng hōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shíliù yuè nǎi zuò zhǔ. Before this, in winter, Duke Lí passed away, and sixteen months later, his spirit tablet was made.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hòu liù yuè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yòu jí dì yú Tàimiào ér zhì Lí Gōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:22:26.335+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*Chūnqiū* jī zhī. Six months later, they again performed the Dì sacrifice at the Great Temple and included Duke Lí, which the *Spring and Autumn Annals* criticized.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shí yì chén yǐwéi kǒng yǒu shuǐzāi. The officials of the time thought this foreboded a flood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shǔ, Rats,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dàoqiè xiǎo chóng, are thieving little creatures</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yè chū zhòu nì; that come out at night and hide during the day;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jīn zhòu qù xué ér dēng mù, Now they leave their holes during the day and climb trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xiàng jiàn rén jiāng jū xiǎnguì zhī wèi yě. which symbolizes lowly people rising to positions of prominence and nobility.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tóngbǎi, Tóngbǎi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wèi Sī Hòu yuán suǒzài yě. was the location of the garden of Empress Wèi Sī.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qí hòu, Later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Huánghòu zì wēijiàn dēng zhì zūn, Empress Zhào rose from humble origins to the highest position,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ Wèi hòu tónglèi. like Empress Wèi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào hòu zhōng wúzi ér wéi hài. Empress Zhào ultimately had no children and caused harm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Míngnián, The following year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǒu yuān fén cháo, a kite burned its nest,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shā zǐ zhī yì yě. a strange occurrence of killing its offspring.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tiānxiàng réng jiàn, Celestial omens continued to appear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shén kěwèi yě. which were truly frightening.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yī yuē, One account says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiē Wáng Mǎng qiè wèi zhī xiàng yún. that all these were omens of Wáng Mǎng usurping the throne.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng "Yì Zhuàn" yuē: Jīng Fáng's commentary on the *Book of Changes* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Chén sī lù wǎng pì, "When officials selfishly pursue their own gains without restraint,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jué yāo shǔ cháo." the anomaly is that rats nest."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wén Gōng shísān nián, In the thirteenth year of Duke Wén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"dà shì wū huài". "the roof of the great chamber collapsed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn jīn lì mù, Metal in close proximity injures wood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">mù dòng yě. and wood moves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xiān shì, Prior to this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dōng, in winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Lí Gōng hōng, Duke Lí died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shílìu yuè nǎi zuò zhǔ. and in the sixteenth month, they erected an ancestral tablet.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hòu liù yuè, Six months later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yòu jí dì yú tàimiào ér zhì Lí Gōng, they again performed the Dì sacrifice in the Great Temple and enshrined Duke Lí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:23:13.88+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Chūnqiū" jī zhī. the *Spring and Autumn Annals* criticized this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shí yì chén yǐwéi kǒng yǒu shuǐzāi. The ministers of the time thought that there might be a flood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shǔ, Rats,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dàoqiè xiǎo chóng, are thieving little creatures,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yè chū zhòu nì; coming out at night and hiding during the day;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jīn zhòu qù xué ér dēng mù, now, during the day, they leave their holes and climb trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xiàng jiàn rén jiāng jū xiǎnguì zhī wèi yě. which symbolizes that lowly people will occupy positions of high rank.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tóngbǎi, Tóngbǎi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wèi Sī hòu yuán suǒzài yě. was the location of Empress Wèi Sī's garden.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qí hòu, Afterwards,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào huánghòu zì wēijiàn dēng zhì zūn, Empress Zhào rose from a humble status to the highest position,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ Wèi hòu tónglèi. like Empress Wèi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào hòu zhōng wú zǐ ér wéi hài. Empress Zhào ultimately had no children and caused harm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Míngnián, The following year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǒu yuān fén cháo, there was a kite that burned its nest,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shā zǐ zhī yì yě. an omen of killing its offspring.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tiānxiàng réng jiàn, The celestial phenomena continued to appear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shèn kěwèi yě. which was very frightening.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yī yuē, Some said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiē Wáng Mǎng qiè wèi zhī xiàng yún. that all were omens of Wáng Mǎng usurping the throne.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng 《Yì Zhuàn》 yuē: Jīng Fáng's commentary on the *Book of Changes* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Chén sī lù wǎng pì, "When ministers privately accumulate wealth without restraint,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-92a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jué yāo shǔ cháo." the resulting portent is rats nesting."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wén gōng shísān nián, In the thirteenth year of Duke Wén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"dà shì wū huài". "the roof of the great chamber collapsed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn jīn lì mù, Metal is close to and harms wood;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">mù dòng yě. wood moves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xiānshì, Prior to this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dōng, in winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xī gōng hōng, Duke Xī died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shíliù yuè nǎi zuò zhǔ. and only in the sixteenth month was his spirit tablet made.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hòu liù yuè, Six months later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yòu jí dì yú tàimiào ér zhì Xī gōng, they again performed the *dì* sacrifice in the Grand Temple and brought in Duke Xī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:24:31.637+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">《Chūnqiū》 jī zhī. which the *Spring and Autumn Annals* criticized.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:09.944+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dōng, in winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:09.944+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xī Gōng hōng, Duke Xī died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:09.944+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shílù yuè nǎi zuò zhǔ. and it was only in the sixteenth month that a spirit tablet was made.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:09.944+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hòu liù yuè, Six months later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:09.944+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yòu jí dì yú tài miào ér zhì Xī Gōng, they again performed the Dì sacrifice at the ancestral temple and enshrined Duke Xī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:09.944+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Chūnqiū" jī zhī. and the "Spring and Autumn Annals" criticized this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:40.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">outwardly, it shows disobedience and usurpation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:40.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, in this year, it did not rain from the twelfth month</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:40.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">until the seventh month of autumn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:40.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the following year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:40.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this happened three times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:40.866+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the roof of the Grand Chamber collapsed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Externally, it means that words are not followed and there is usurpation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, in that year, it did not rain from the twelfth month</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">until the seventh month of autumn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The following year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this happened three times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the roof of the Tàishì 太室 collapsed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The front hall is called the Tàimiào 太廟,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the central hall is called the Tàishì 太室;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the roof,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">specifically the upper, multi-tiered, and elevated roof,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizes that Lǔ 魯 would decline from this point onward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and would bring about the fall of the sacrifices to the Duke of Zhōu 周公.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The "Gǔliáng 穀梁" and "Gōngyáng Jīng 公羊經" state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Shìshì 世室</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the temple of Bó Qín 伯禽, the Duke of Lǔ 魯.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Duke of Zhōu 周公 is referred to as Tàimiào 太廟,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Duke of Lǔ 魯 is referred to as Shìshì 世室.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">A major event</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the xiá jì 祫祭 (joint sacrifice).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The elevation of Duke Lì 釐公</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-93a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">means prioritizing the father over the grandfather.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twelfth month of the third year of Emperor Jǐng 景,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">two city gates of Wú 吳 collapsed on their own,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and large ships overturned on their own.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 believed this was because metal was close to harming wood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and wood was in motion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Before this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the King of Wú 吳, Pī 濞, because his son died in Hàn 漢,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">claimed illness and did not attend court,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">secretly plotting rebellion with the King of Chǔ 楚, Wù 戊.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The city is like a state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">one of its gates was named the Chǔ Mén 楚門 (Chǔ Gate),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:26:52.047+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and one gate was called the Yú Mén 魚門 (Fish Gate).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:26.539+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">King Bì 濞 of Wú, because his son had died in Hàn 漢,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:26.539+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">claimed illness and did not attend the court,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:26.539+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">secretly plotting rebellion with King Wù 戊 of Chǔ 楚.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:26.539+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The city is like the state;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:26.539+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">one of its gates was named the Chǔ 楚 Gate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-94a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:26.539+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and another gate was called the Yú 魚 Gate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:56.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At the time, Xián held a high position due to personal favoritism,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:56.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">his rewards and gifts were without measure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:56.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he was arrogant, disrespectful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:56.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and greatly deviated from the proper path of a minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:56.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He saw the warning but did not change.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:27:56.689+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, Xián and his wife committed suicide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Contemporary worthies, because of personal favor, occupied high positions;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">rewards and bestowals were without limit;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">they were arrogant, disrespectful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">greatly failed in the way of a minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and did not change even when admonished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, Xián and his wife committed suicide,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-96a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and their family was exiled to Hépǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The commentary says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"If words are not heeded,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this is called not being well-governed;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the resulting calamity is usurpation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the resulting punishment is prolonged brightness [fire/drought],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the ultimate result is sorrow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, there will be poetic omens,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">at that time, there will be calamities of armored insects,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">at that time, there will be dog disasters,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">at that time, there will be diseases of the mouth and tongue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">at that time, there will be white prodigies and white auspicious signs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-97a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is only wood overcoming metal."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Yán zhī bù cóng"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Cóng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">means compliant/obedient.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Shì wèi bù yì"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yì</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">means to govern.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Kǒngzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"If a gentleman, residing in his chamber,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">utters words that are not good,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then those a thousand *lǐ* away will oppose him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how much more those who are near!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Classic of Poetry* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:08.87+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Like the cicada and the mantis,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:38.757+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"If a gentleman, residing in his chamber,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:38.757+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">utters words that are not good,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:38.757+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then those thousands of miles away will go against him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:38.757+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how much more so those near to him!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:38.757+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Book of Odes says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:28:38.757+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Like cicadas and mantises,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:11.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which are born of *yáng* energy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:11.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Chūnqiū* 春秋 (Spring and Autumn Annals), they are called *zhōng* 螽,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:11.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">now they are called *huáng* 蝗 (locusts),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:11.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">all are of this type.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:11.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Yì* 易 (Book of Changes),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:11.17+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*Duì* 兌 represents the mouth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is produced by the Yáng Qì (陽氣).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Chūnqiū* (春秋), it is called zhōng (螽);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">now it is called huáng (蝗),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and they are all of the same kind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Yì* (易),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*Duì* (兌) represents the mouth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dogs bark to guard,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but they cannot be trusted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This means that when the Qì (氣) is ruined, there will be calamity related to dogs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is also said</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">that in a drought year, many dogs go mad and die or become monstrous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which is also an example of this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">As for people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">many will suffer from diseases of the mouth and throat, and coughs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">hence there will be diseases and troubles of the mouth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The color is gold and white,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">hence there will be white omens and white auspicious signs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In general, those who are said to be afflicted</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are suffering from diseases of the metal Qì (金氣);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">when the metal Qì (金氣) is diseased,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then the wood element will attack it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">For those who are extremely worried,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">if they follow along with it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">their blessing will be called health and peace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn (劉歆) in his commentaries says that there will be disasters of hairy creatures at times.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The explanation is that in astronomy, the constellation Shēn (參) in the west is the tiger star,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-98a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">hence it represents hairy creatures.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Shǐjì* (史記), Zhōu Dānxiānggōng (周單襄公) spoke to Jìn Xì Qǐ (晉郤錡), Xì Chōu (郤犨), Xì Zhì (郤至), and Qí Guózhuǒ (齊國佐),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and told Lǔ Chénggōng (魯成公):</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Jìn (晉) is about to have troubles;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the three Xì (郤) will be the ones to face them!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Xì (郤) clan</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:29:19.975+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are the favored people of Jìn (晉).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:15.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Shǐjì*, Zhōu Dān Xiāng Gōng spoke with Jìn Xì Qí, Xì Chōu, Xì Zhì, and Qí Guó Zuǒ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:15.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and told Lǔ Chéng Gōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:15.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Jìn is about to have unrest,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:15.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the three Xì will surely be involved!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:15.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Xì clan,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:15.75+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are the favored people of Jìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:46.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qí killed Guó Zuǒ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:46.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">All of this category,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-99a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:46.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are said to be the consequences of not heeding advice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-100a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:46.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-100a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:46.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn Mù Hóu had a crown prince born during the campaign at Tiáo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-100a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:30:46.836+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and named him Chóu;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-100a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:31:14.363+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">enfeoffing Chéng Shī at Qūwò,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-100a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:31:14.363+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">with the title of Huán Shū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-100a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:31:14.363+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, the people of Jìn killed Zhāo Hóu and tried to install Huán Shū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-100a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:31:14.363+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but were unsuccessful.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-100a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:31:14.363+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">They then installed Zhāo Hóu's son, Xiào Hóu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-100a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:31:14.363+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but Huán Shū's son, Yán Bó, killed him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-102a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:14.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zǐ Róng is autocratic,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-102a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:14.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Sītú is extravagant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-102a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:14.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">both are rulers who will ruin their families.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-102a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:14.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Autocracy will lead to swift calamity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-102a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:14.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">extravagance will exhaust their power,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-102a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:14.997+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">autocracy will surely be exhausted by others,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:54.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">what use is there in establishing [goodwill]!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:54.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Mùshū (穆叔) told someone, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:54.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Mèngsūn (孟孫) is about to die!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:54.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">I told him about the carelessness of Zhào Mèng (趙孟),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:54.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but he is even worse."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:32:54.102+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the ninth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Of what use will it be to plant them!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Mù Shū 穆叔 told someone, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Mèng Sūn 孟孫 is about to die!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">I told him about Zhào Mèng's 趙孟 laxity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and he is even worse than that."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the ninth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-103a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Mèng Xiàobó 孟孝伯 died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first year of Duke Zhāo 昭公,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Zhou 周 envoy, Liú Dìnggōng 劉定公, came to express sympathy on behalf of the Zhou court to Zhào Mèng 趙孟 of Jin 晉,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and then said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"You wear the cap and robes of office to preside over the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">why not also follow the distant achievements of Yǔ 禹,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and greatly protect the people?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He replied:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"This old man is fearful of his crimes and faults,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how can I care for distant affairs?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">We are just eating like common laborers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">not planning for the morrow in the morning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how can we last long?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liúzi 劉子 returned</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and reported to the King, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The proverb says, 'The old general is wise, but old age overtakes him,'</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">that must be referring to Zhào Mèng 趙孟!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He is the chief minister of Jin 晉 and presides over the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but he acts like a common laborer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">not planning for the morrow in the morning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he has abandoned the spirits and the people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If the spirits are angry and the people rebel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how can he last long?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Mèng 趙孟 will not live another year!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">That year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the younger brother of Duke Jǐng 景 of Qin 秦, Hòuzǐ 后子, fled to Jin 晉,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:06.068+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Mèng 趙孟 asked:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:52.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The gods are angry, and the people rebel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:52.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how can he last long?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:52.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Mèng 趙孟 will not live another year!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:52.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In this year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:52.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the younger brother of Duke Jǐng 景 of Qín 秦, Hòuzǐ 后子, fled to Jìn 晉,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:33:52.062+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Mèng 趙孟 asked:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:34:49.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it will rarely not last for five harvests."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:34:49.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Mèng 赵孟 looked at the shadow</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:34:49.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:34:49.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Morning and evening do not reach each other;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:34:49.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">who can wait for five?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-104a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:34:49.159+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Hòuzǐ 后子 went out and told people:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-105a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:06.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">should you not worry?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-105a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:06.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qí Guó Zǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-105a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:06.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"I feel sorry for the two of you."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-105a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:06.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chén Gōngzǐ Zhāo said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-105a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:06.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Without worry, what can be accomplished?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-105a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:06.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The two of you are happy!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:49.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jí Tán of Jìn went to Zhōu to attend the funeral of the Mù Empress.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:49.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">After the mourning period was over and a banquet was held,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:49.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the King said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:49.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The various lords all have ways to support and soothe the Royal House,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:49.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">only Jìn has none,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:36:49.501+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">why is that?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:16.919+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Will the Jí clan have no descendants?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:16.919+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He knows the records but forgets his ancestors."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:16.919+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jí Tán returned home</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:16.919+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and told Shū Xiàng about it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:16.919+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shū Xiàng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-106a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:16.919+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The King will probably not last long!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-107a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:51.305+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the sixteenth year of Duke Āi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-107a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:51.305+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Kǒng Qiū died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-107a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:51.305+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Duke eulogized him, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-107a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:51.305+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Compassionate Heaven does not pity me</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-107a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:51.305+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and is unwilling to leave one old man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-107a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:37:51.305+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">to assist me, the lonely one."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-108a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:38:31.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is called no rain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-108a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:38:31.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's "Commentary on the Book of Changes" says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-108a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:38:31.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Desiring virtue but not employing it is called boasting,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-108a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:38:31.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its disaster is famine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-108a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:38:31.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Famine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-108a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:38:31.31+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is drought.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-109a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:01.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and Duke Lì 釐 especially gained the favor of Chǔ 楚.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-109a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:01.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chǔ 楚 came to present trophies of victory,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-109a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:01.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">releasing those imprisoned from Sòng 宋.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-109a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:01.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Relying externally on the powerful Chǔ 楚,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-109a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:01.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">resisting Yang and losing the people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-109a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:01.137+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and also constructing the South Gate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-111a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:30.849+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Year eight: "Ninth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-111a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:30.849+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">great rain prayer."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-111a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:30.849+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At the time, he established three armies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-111a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:30.849+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Jì (季) family flourished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-112a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:30.849+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-112a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:39:30.849+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Year twenty-eight: "Eighth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-114a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:21.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and achieved victory over neighboring countries,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-114a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:21.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">having the response of being arrogant and mobilizing the people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:21.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:21.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Year sixteen, "ninth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:21.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">great drought."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:21.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Prior to this, Duke Zhāo's 昭公 mother, Lady Guī 歸氏, passed away,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-114a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">To achieve victory over neighboring states,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-114a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there must be responses to resist yang and mobilize the masses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the sixteenth year, "ninth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a great rain (dà yú)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Prior to this, the mother of Duke Zhāo (Zhāo Gōng), Lady Guī (Guī shì), passed away,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but Duke Zhāo (Zhāo) did not grieve,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and he also held a great hunt at Bǐ Pú.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jìn Shū Xiàng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Lǔ has a great mourning and does not abandon the hunt.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The state does not care about the mourning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and does not respect the ruler;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the ruler lacks a grieving expression,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and does not consider his kin.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is likely he will lose the state."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-115a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is the same prognostication as that of the third year.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twenty-fourth year, "eighth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a great rain (dà yú)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn believed that in the *Zuǒ Zhuàn*’s twenty-third year, the troops of Zhū built the city of Yì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">passing through the territory of Lǔ on their return,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and Lǔ ambushed and captured the Zhū troops,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">seizing their three senior officials.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The people of Zhū complained to Jìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the people of Jìn detained my envoy, Shū Sūn Ruò,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-116a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and he was returned in the spring.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twenty-fifth year, "seventh month, on the day *shàng xīn*, a great rain (dà yú),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">on the day *jì xīn* there was another rain (yú),"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the drought was severe.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn believed that at this time the Hòu lineage and the Jì lineage had a feud.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Furthermore, there was an adulterous wife in the Jì lineage who slandered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">causing Jì Píng Zǐ to be at odds with his kinsmen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:40:33.491+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and they all jointly denounced Píng Zǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:14.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">on the last *xīn* 辛 day, there was another drought,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:14.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the drought was severe.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:14.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn 劉歆 believed that at this time, the Hòu 后 clan and the Jì 季 clan were at odds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:14.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Furthermore, a promiscuous wife of a member of the Jì 季 clan slandered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:14.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">causing Jì Píngzǐ 季平子 to become estranged from his clansmen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-117a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:14.054+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and they all conspired to slander Píngzǐ 平子.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-120a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:55.274+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"in the sixth month it rained."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-120a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:55.274+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Before this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-120a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:55.274+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yán Gōng's wife had an affair with Gōngzǐ Qìngfù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-120a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:55.274+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and they killed two rulers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-120a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:55.274+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The people of the state attacked them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-120a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:41:55.274+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the wife fled to Zhū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-122a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:21.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the tenth year:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-122a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:21.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"From the first month, there was no rain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-122a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:21.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">until the seventh month of autumn."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-122a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:21.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Before this, Gōngzǐ Suì (公子遂) had assembled four states to rescue Zhèng (鄭).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-122a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:21.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Chǔ (楚) sent Yuè Jiāo (越椒) to come and make a diplomatic visit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-122a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:21.968+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The people of Qín (秦) returned the funeral shrouds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-123a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:50.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizing that benefits do not proceed from above,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-123a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:50.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but that ministers create blessings and achieve success privately.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-123a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:50.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is said that,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-123a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:50.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">no rain approximates the punishment for constant yin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-123a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:50.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and that the ruler is weak.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-124a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:42:50.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-126a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:19.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, the Xiongnu greatly invaded Shang Commandery and Yúnzhōng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-126a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:19.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Beacon fires reached Cháng'ān,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-126a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:19.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and three generals were stationed at the border,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-126a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:19.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">with another three generals stationed in the capital.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-127a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:19.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-127a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:19.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the autumn of the third year of the middle reign of Emperor Jǐng (Jǐng Dì),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-131a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:46.846+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">conscripted people were sent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-131a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:46.846+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the summer of the second year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-131a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:46.846+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">three generals campaigned against the Xiongnu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-131a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:46.846+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and Lǐ Líng 李陵 was lost and did not return.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-132a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:46.846+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-132a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:43:46.846+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the summer of the first year of the Zhēnghé 征和 reign period,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-136a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:15.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the summers of the third and fourth years of the Yǒngshǐ reign of Emperor Chéng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-136a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:15.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was a great drought.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:15.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:15.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Zuǒ Zhuàn* records a children's rhyme from the time of Duke Xiàn of Jìn, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:15.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"On the morning of bǐng-▸[zǐ]◂, [fn:: The Jǐngyòu edition has the character "子". Wáng Niànsūn says the Jǐngyòu edition is correct.]</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:15.401+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the tail of the dragon lies in Chén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:43.933+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twelfth month of winter, on the first day of bǐngzǐ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:43.933+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the army of Jìn destroyed Guó,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:43.933+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and Lord Chǒu of Guó fled to the Zhōu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:43.933+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The twelfth month of Zhōu</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:43.933+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the tenth month of summer.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-137a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:44:43.933+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Those who speak of the heavens use the summer calendar as the standard.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:29.827+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The starling and the oriole,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:29.827+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Duke goes out to be humiliated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:29.827+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The starling's and oriole's feathers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:29.827+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Duke is in the outer fields;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:29.827+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">go and feed them to the horses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:29.827+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The starling and oriole hopping about,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Qú zhī yù zhī,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gōng chū rǔ zhī.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qú yù zhī yǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gōng zài wài yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">wǎng kuì zhī mǎ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qú yù zhū zhū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gōng zài Gānhóu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">zhēng qiān yǔ rú.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qú yù zhī cháo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yuǎn zāi yáo yáo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chóufù sàng láo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Sòngfù yǐ jiāo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Qú yù qú yù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">wǎng gē lái kū."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When it came to the time of Duke Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a starling came to nest.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Duke attacked the Jì family,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was defeated,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">fled to Qí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">resided in the outer fields,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">stopped at Gānhóu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the eighth year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he died abroad,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and was returned for burial in Lǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Duke Zhāo's name was Chóu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Gōngzǐ Sòng was established,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-139a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this was Duke Dìng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">During the time of Emperor Yuán, a children's rhyme said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Well water overflows,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">extinguishes the smoke of the stove,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">floods the Jade Hall,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">flows through the Golden Gate."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:45:47.487+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the second year of the Jianshi reign of Emperor Cheng, the day wùzǐ in the third month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:48:41.599+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">During the time of Emperor Yuán, there was a children's rhyme that said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:48:41.599+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Well water overflows,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:48:41.599+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">extinguishing the smoke from the stove,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:48:41.599+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">flooding the jade hall,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:48:41.599+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">flowing through the golden gate."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-140a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:48:41.599+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">By the time of Emperor Chéng, the wùzǐ day of the third month of the second year of the Jiànshǐ era,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-141a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:18.49+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the swallow flies here,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-141a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:18.49+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">pecking the emperor's grandson,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-141a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:18.49+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the emperor's grandson dies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-141a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:18.49+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the swallow pecks an arrow."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-141a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:18.49+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, the emperor, when traveling incognito,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-141a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:18.49+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">would often go out with the Marquis of Fùpíng, Zhāng Fàng, both claiming to be members of the Marquis of Fùpíng's household.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-142a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:50.479+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Now pitied by all."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-142a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:50.479+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Cinnamon,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-142a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:50.479+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is red in color,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-142a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:50.479+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizing the Hàn dynasty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-142a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:50.479+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Blooming without bearing fruit</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-142a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:49:50.479+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">means having no heir.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-143a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:51:16.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū zhǐ lüè tóng. (Dǒng Zhòngshū's interpretation is roughly the same.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-143a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:51:16.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng "Yì Zhuàn" yuē: (Jīng Fáng's "Commentary on the Book of Changes" says:)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-143a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:51:16.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Fèi zhèng zuò yín, (Abandoning what is righteous and engaging in lewdness,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-143a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:51:16.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dà bù míng, (causes great obscurity,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-143a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:51:16.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">guó duō mí." (and the country will have many elk.")</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-143a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T22:51:16.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yòu yuē: (It also says:)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-145a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The people of the state surrounded it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-145a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chén was afraid</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-145a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and fled to Chén.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-145a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Previously, Chén's elder brother Yuè was a minister of Sòng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-145a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yuè died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-145a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and Chén sent an assassin to kill Yuè's household manager.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-146a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When divined,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-146a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it was determined that Zhào Wáng Rúyì (趙王如意) was the cause of the affliction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-146a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Consequently, the emperor fell ill from a wound in his side and died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-146a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Previously, Empress Gāo (高后) had poisoned Rúyì (如意),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-146a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">severed the hands and feet of his mother, Lady Qī (戚夫人),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-146a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:09:21.019+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and gouged out her eyes, turning her into a "human pig."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-147a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:28:52.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Eventually, the Hàn (漢) army defeated Wú (吳) and Chǔ (楚),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-147a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:28:52.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and consequently executed the four kings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-147a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:28:52.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, when the celestial dog descended upon Liáng (梁), Wú (吳) and Chǔ (楚) attacked Liáng (梁);</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-147a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:28:52.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">when a dog grew horns in Qí (齊), the three kingdoms besieged Qí (齊).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-147a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:28:52.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Hàn (漢) army ultimately defeated Wú (吳) and Chǔ (楚) in Liáng (梁),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-147a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:28:52.785+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and executed the four kings in Qí (齊).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-148a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:29:25.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">results in the generation of harm.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-148a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:29:25.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's 京房 *Yì Zhuàn* 《易傳》 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-148a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:29:25.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When the roles of husband and wife are not properly distinguished,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-148a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:29:25.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the corresponding omen is a dog mating with a pig.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-148a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:29:25.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is called a reversal of virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-148a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:29:25.151+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the state will experience military conflict."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-151a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:30:05.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but it turned into stone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-151a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:30:05.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At this time, Prince Cháo 鼂 usurped the Emperor's throne.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-151a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:30:05.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The people did not support him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-151a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:30:05.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and his commands were not followed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-151a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:30:05.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, the jade transformed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-151a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:30:05.154+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which was a near omen of calamity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-152a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:33:06.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a stone fell in Dōng Commandery (Dōng Jùn).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-152a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:33:06.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Some people carved on the stone:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-152a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:33:06.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The First Emperor will die and the land will be divided."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-152a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:33:06.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">These were all portents of misfortune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-152a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:33:06.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">scorching Yang energy and violent cruelty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-152a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:33:06.034+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">orders were not followed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-153a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:36:49.605+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At the place where the stone stood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-153a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:36:49.605+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">several thousand white crows gathered beside it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-153a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:36:49.605+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Suī Mèng (眭孟) believed that stone is a *yin* category,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-153a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:36:49.605+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizing the common people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-153a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:36:49.605+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Tài Shān (泰山) is Mount Dàizōng (岱宗),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-153a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-04T23:36:49.605+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a place where kings change their surnames and announce a new dynasty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-33a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-05T14:14:54.297+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】故順其便利而尊崇之。【總結】「因」譯為「順」以貼近古語「因勢利導」之意，「尊之」補充為「尊崇之」強化禮儀色彩。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-33a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-05T14:18:20.47+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】故依其資財之用而禁之。【總結】「讋」取《廣雅》「禁」義，譯為「禁之」；「資」補譯為「資財之用」以完足語意。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-33a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-05T14:26:10.735+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】故藉太祖之威以繫縛其心。【總結】「累」譯為「繫縛」，較「約束」更具體；增補「之威」二字，突顯神明威懾力。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-33a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-05T14:29:42.481+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】故假託鬼神以申明誡命也。【總結】「託」譯為「假託」強化虛構意味；「申誡」譯為「申明誡命」擴充為四字格，增強莊重感。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-33a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-05T14:34:41.354+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】唯通道理者能明其真意。【總結】「有道者」譯為「通道理者」，使主體更明確；「通其志」轉譯為「明其真意」，深化理解層次。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-154a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:19:30.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in the eighth month of the third year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-154a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:19:30.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it rained white hair (of a yak tail).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-154a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:19:30.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's *Book of Changes Commentary* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-154a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:19:30.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"If there is joy before sorrow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-154a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:19:30.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the corresponding omen is a rain of feathers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-154a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:19:30.204+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It also says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-155a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:09.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Three generations later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-155a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:09.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhōu 周 surrendered its destiny to Qín 秦.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-155a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:09.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Afterwards, Qín 秦 finally extinguished Zhōu 周,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-155a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:09.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and seized the nine cauldrons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-155a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:09.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The trembling of the nine cauldrons</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-155a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:09.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was wood harming metal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:52.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is called not being wise;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:52.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its fault is laxity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:52.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its punishment is constant darkness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:52.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its extreme is disease.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:52.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At times there are plant anomalies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:21:52.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">at times there are misfortunes of emaciated insects."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is called not being wise;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its faults are lax,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its punishments are constantly obscure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its extremes are rapid.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At times there are plant anomalies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">at times there are misfortunes of emaciated insects,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">at times there are calamities involving sheep,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">at times there are eye diseases,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">at times there are red omens and red portents.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-157a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is only water overcoming fire."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"If you look at them without understanding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this is called not being wise,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*zhé* (悊),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">means knowledge.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Book of Poetry* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Your virtue is not clear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and so you lose attendants and lose ministers;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">not understanding your virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and so you lose backbones and lose supports."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It speaks of the ruler being unclear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">obscured by darkness and confusion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and therefore being unable to distinguish good from evil,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">befriending flatterers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">promoting those of the same kind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">those without merit are rewarded,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">those with crimes are not killed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the officials are ruined and in disarray,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the fault lies in laxity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore its faults are lax.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In high summer the days are long,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the heat nourishes things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the government is relaxed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:22:04.854+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore its punishments are constantly obscure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:01.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The fault lies in being lenient and slow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:01.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore its fault is leniency.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:01.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In high summer, the days are long,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:01.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the heat nourishes things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:01.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">so governance is relaxed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:01.361+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore its punishment is constantly obscure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:48.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Classic of Changes* (*Yì*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:48.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">strength (gāng) encompassing gentleness (róu) forms the hexagram *Lí* (離).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:48.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*Lí* is fire and is the eye.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:48.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">A sheep with horns above and cloven hooves below,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:48.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">strength encompassing gentleness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:24:48.971+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the sheep has large eyes but lacks keen sight,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:25:41.106+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This explanation is not correct.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:25:41.106+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Regarding the constant obscurity of the many omens,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:25:41.106+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 believed it was the absence of ice in the *Chūnqiū* (Spring and Autumn Annals).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:25:41.106+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Small obscurities were not recorded,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:25:41.106+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but the absence of ice was then recorded,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-158a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:25:41.106+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">because it was a significant event.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-159a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:26:14.456+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Daring not to carry out punishments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-159a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:26:14.456+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhèng Bó Tū 鄭伯突 usurped his elder brother and established himself (as ruler).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-159a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:26:14.456+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The duke maintained friendly relations with him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-159a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:26:14.456+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">nurturing those of the same kind (as Zhèng Bó Tū 鄭伯突),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-159a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:26:14.456+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and not clearly distinguishing between good and evil in punishments.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-159a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:26:14.456+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū 董仲舒 believed that this symbolized the impropriety of the lady (the duke's wife).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-161a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:11.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">不敢行誅罰，[bù gǎn xíng zhū fá,] daring not to execute punishments;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-161a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:11.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">楚有夷狄行，[Chǔ yǒu yídí xíng,] Chǔ had barbarian practices,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-161a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:11.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">公有從楚心，[gōng yǒu cóng Chǔ xīn,] the duke had a mind to follow Chǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-161a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:11.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">不明善惡之應。[bù míng shàn è zhī yìng.] this is a lack of discernment regarding the responses to good and evil.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-161a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:11.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">董仲舒[Dǒng Zhòngshū] 指略同。[zhǐ lüè tóng.] Dǒng Zhòngshū's interpretation is roughly the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-161a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:11.706+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">一曰，[yī yuē,] One says,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-161a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:45.63+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore the Zhōu declined and perished in a cold year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-161a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:45.63+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Qín were destroyed in a warm year.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-162a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:45.63+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-162a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:45.63+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the winter of the sixth year of the Yuán Shòu reign of Emperor Wǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-162a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:45.63+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was no ice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-162a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:27:45.63+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Prior to this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-164a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:28:31.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the thirty-third year of Duke Xī 僖 of Lǔ 魯 (627 BC), "in the twelfth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-164a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:28:31.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">falling frost did not kill the grass."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-164a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:28:31.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn 劉歆 thought this was a grass omen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-164a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:28:31.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 thought that what is now the tenth month</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-164a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:28:31.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was the Zhōu 周's twelfth month.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-164a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:28:31.908+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">According to the *Yì*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-164a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:29:36.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When a subject is slack, this is called disobedience;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-164a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:29:36.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its anomaly is that frost does not kill."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-165a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:29:36.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-165a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:29:36.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Preface to the Book of Documents* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-165a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:29:36.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Yī Zhì assisted Tài Wù,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-165a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:29:36.33+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and in Bó, there was an auspicious mulberry and grain growing together."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:20.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:20.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Shū Xù* also says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:20.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Gāozōng was sacrificing to Chéng Tāng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:20.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">when a flying pheasant landed on the ear of the tripod and crowed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:20.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zǔ Jǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:20.674+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Thinking of the former fake king,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:54.36+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">ruining the sacrifices to the ancestral temple.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:54.36+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wild trees growing in the court,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:54.36+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">wild birds entering the temple,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:54.36+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are anomalies of defeat and ruin.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:54.36+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wǔ Dīng, frightened and alarmed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-166a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:30:54.36+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">consulted with loyal and virtuous men.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:31:27.564+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the blossoming is not written about;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:31:27.564+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">only the more significant event is mentioned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:31:27.564+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yin completing Yang affairs</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:31:27.564+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizes ministers presuming the authority and blessings of the sovereign.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:31:27.564+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">First,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:31:27.564+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">winter should be a time of killing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:04.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Winter</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:04.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the season when water is dominant,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:04.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and wood is assisting,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:04.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">hence it symbolizes great ministers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:04.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn believed that all omens of evil were caused by insects,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-167a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:04.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and that such thoughts would result in snails and *zhū* insects.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:48.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">without an heir.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:48.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The King of Chāngyì 昌邑, Hè 賀, was summoned to inherit the throne,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:48.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but he was wild and lost his way.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:48.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Guāng 光 deposed him</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:48.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and established the grandson of Emperor Zhāo's 昭帝 brother, the Heir Apparent Wèi 衛,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:32:48.723+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">who became Emperor Xuān 宣帝.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wú zǐ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">he summoned Hè, the King of Chāngyì, to inherit the throne.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He was mad and lost his way.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Guāng deposed him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and established the grandson of the elder brother of Emperor Zhāo, the grandson of the Crown Prince Wèi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">who became Emperor Xuān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Emperor's original name was Bìngyǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's Commentary on the *Yijing* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"A withered willow sprouts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a dead tree revives,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-168a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the ruler lacks a son."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fourth year of the Chūyuán era of Emperor Yuán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the cypress pillars of the tomb gate of Queen’s Empress’s great-great-grandfather Bó, the King of Dōngpínglíng of Jǐnán, suddenly grew branches and leaves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">extending above the roof.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed this was a sign that the Wáng family would become prominent and replace the Hàn family.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, Wáng Mǎng usurped the throne</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and explained it himself, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"In the fourth year of Chūyuán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the year Mǎng was born,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">corresponding to the Han's ninth-generation tribulation of the fire element,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this auspicious omen occurred at the gate of my ancestor Gāozǔ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The gate signifies opening and expansion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the cypress tree is like a son,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">meaning that the Wáng family will have a virtuous son who will open up and continue the ancestral line,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">rising from the position of a pillar-like great minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-169a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and this is a symbol of receiving the mandate to become king."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fifth year of the Jiànzhāo era,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Inspector of Yǎnzhōu, Hào Shǎng, forbade the people from privately establishing shrines.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In Tuómáo village in Shānyáng, a large Chinese scholartree stood at the village shrine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">An official chopped it down,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but that night, the tree returned to its original place.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:33:03.103+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the second month of the first year of the Yǒngshǐ era of Emperor Chéng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:34:34.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fifth year of the Jiànzhāo (Jiànzhāo) reign period,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:34:34.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Inspector of Yǎn Province, Hào Shǎng (Hào Shǎng), prohibited the people from privately establishing local shrines.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:34:34.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the Tuómáo (Tuómáo) village shrine in Shānyáng (Shānyáng), there was a large Chinese locust tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:34:34.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The officials cut it down,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:34:34.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but that night the tree restored itself to its original place.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-170a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:34:34.965+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first year of the Yǒngshǐ (Yǒngshǐ) reign period of Emperor Chéng (Chéng Dì), in the second month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:36:22.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">all of which was withered.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:36:22.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:36:22.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the tree suddenly re-erected itself in its original place.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:36:22.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's (京房) *Yì Zhuàn* (易傳) states:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:36:22.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Abandoning the proper and engaging in lewdness</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:36:22.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, the omen is a tree broken but reattached itself."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">all withered.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the tree suddenly stood up again in its original place.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's 京房 *Yì Zhuàn* 《易傳》says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Abandoning righteousness and engaging in licentiousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the portent is a broken tree reattaching itself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If a consort or empress is autocratic,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a fallen tree will stand up again,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a broken and withered tree will revive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven abhors this."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the eighth month of the second year of the Yǒngguāng 永光 reign of Emperor Yuán 元,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it rained grass,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the leaves were intertwined,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">as large as bullets.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first month of the third year of the Yuánshǐ 元始 reign of Emperor Píng 平,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it rained grass,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">resembling the time of Yǒngguāng 永光.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's 京房 *Yì Zhuàn* 《易傳》 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"If the ruler is stingy with emoluments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">trust declines, and the worthy depart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the portent is that heaven rains grass."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twenty-fifth year of Duke Zhāo 昭, "In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*qúyù* 鸜鵒 birds came to nest."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn 劉歆 considered it an abnormality of feathered creatures,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its color being black,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which is also an ominous sign of blackness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a punishment for unclear vision and dull hearing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 considered that those that have *fēi* 蜚 and *yù* 蜮 that were not mentioned as coming,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are produced by *qì* 氣,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">what is called an error;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">*qúyù* 鸜鵒 birds being mentioned as coming,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:42:37.157+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are caused by *qì* 氣,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">all withered.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the tree suddenly stood upright in its original place.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng’s 京房 *Yì Zhuàn* 易傳 [Commentary on the Book of Changes] says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Abandoning righteousness and engaging in licentiousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the portent is a tree broken and self-attached.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When a concubine or empress is domineering,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a fallen tree will stand back up,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and a broken and withered tree will be reborn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-171a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven detests such evil."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the eighth month of the second year of the Yǒngguāng 永光 era of Emperor Yuán 元 (of Hàn 漢),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it rained grass,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the leaves were intertwined,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">as large as a pellets.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first month of the third year of the Yuánshǐ 元始 era of Emperor Píng 平,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it rained grass,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">resembling the event during the Yǒngguāng 永光 era.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng’s 京房 *Yì Zhuàn* 易傳 [Commentary on the Book of Changes] says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When the ruler is stingy with emoluments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">trust declines and the worthy depart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-172a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the portent is heaven raining grass."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twenty-fifth year of Duke Zhāo 昭: "In summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">starlings came to nest."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn 劉歆 considered it a disaster caused by feathered creatures,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its color being black,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and black being an ominous sign,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a punishment for unclear vision and dull hearing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 considered that *fēi* 蜚 and *yù* 蜮 (types of mythical creatures) were not mentioned as coming,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">as they are produced by the *qì*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and are so-called calamities.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">But starlings are said to be coming,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:43:26.626+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">caused by the *qì*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:44:14.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a punishment for failing to see clearly and hear wisely.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:44:14.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 considered that for *fēi* 蜚 (a type of locust) and *yù* 蜮 (a type of mythical insect) that "came" is not spoken,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:44:14.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">as they are produced by *qì* 氣,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:44:14.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which are called blemishes;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:44:14.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but for starlings, "came" is spoken,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:44:14.94+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">as they are brought about by *qì* 氣,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:45:27.686+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">fled to Qí 齊,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:45:27.686+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and then died in the outer fields.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-173a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:45:27.686+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū's 董仲舒 interpretation is roughly the same.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-174a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:45:27.686+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-174a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:45:27.686+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the eleventh month of the third year of Emperor Jǐng 景帝,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-174a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:45:27.686+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">white-necked crows and black crows fought in a flock in Lǚ 呂 County, in the state of Chǔ 楚.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-174a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:47:23.565+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the strange event is white and black crows fighting in the country."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:47:23.565+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:47:23.565+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first year of Yuánfèng during the reign of Emperor Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:47:23.565+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there were crows and magpies fighting on the pond in the palace of the King of Yān,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:47:23.565+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the crows fell into the pond and died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:47:23.565+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a black omen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-174a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Its omen: white and black crows fight in the capital."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first year of Yuánfèng of Emperor Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a crow and a magpie fought above the pond in the palace of the Prince of Yàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The crow fell into the pond and died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which presaged something related to black.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, the Prince of Yàn, Dàn, was plotting rebellion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and he ultimately did not change his ways.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He was executed for his crimes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chǔ and Yàn were both related by blood and were feudal vassals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and due to arrogance and resentment, they plotted rebellion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Both experienced the omen of crows and magpies fighting to the death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Their actions were similar, and the omens aligned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is a clear manifestation of Heaven and humanity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In Yàn, one crow and magpie fought in the palace, and the black one died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">while in Chǔ, tens of thousands fought in the wilderness, and the white ones died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This symbolizes that Yàn's conspiracy had not yet been launched,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Prince alone committed suicide in the palace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, one crow of watery color died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chǔ raised troops to resist,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and their army was utterly defeated in the field.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, many crows of golden color died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is the subtle and precise effect of the Dao of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's "Commentary on the Book of Changes" says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When there is arbitrary warfare and robbery and murder,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its omen is crows and magpies fighting."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">During the time of Emperor Zhāo, there was a pelican (or some say a bald vulture)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">that gathered below the hall of the King of Chāngyì.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The King ordered people to shoot and kill it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that this water bird was blue in color,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which was a blue omen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, the King rode wildly without restraint</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:08.235+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and disrespected senior ministers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-174a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Its omen: white and black crows fight in the state."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first year of Yuánfèng during the reign of Emperor Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a crow fought with a magpie above the pond in the palace of the Prince of Yān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The crow fell into the pond and died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This was an ill omen associated with black.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, the Prince of Yān, Dàn, was plotting rebellion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Consequently, he did not change his ways after being warned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He was executed for his crime.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chǔ and Yān were both collateral relatives and vassal lords.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Due to arrogance and resentment, they plotted rebellion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Both experienced the omen of crows and magpies fighting to the death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Their actions were similar, and the omens aligned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is a clear manifestation of the connection between Heaven and humanity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In Yān, one crow and magpie fought in the palace, and the black one died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">while in Chǔ, tens of thousands fought in the wilderness, and the white ones died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This symbolizes that Yān's conspiracy had not yet been launched.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The prince committed suicide alone in the palace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, a single crow of a watery color died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chǔ, on the other hand, raised troops openly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Their army was utterly defeated in the wilderness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, a multitude of crows of a golden color died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is the effect of the subtle and profound workings of the Way of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's commentary on the *Yì* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"To exclusively engage in conquest and robbery and killing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-175a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">its omen is crows and magpies fighting."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">During the reign of Emperor Zhāo, a pelican, or some say a bald-headed heron,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gathered at the palace of the Prince of Chāngyì.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The prince had someone shoot and kill it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that this water bird's color was blue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Blue is an ominous sign.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:51:40.583+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, the prince indulged in reckless pursuits without restraint,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:56:39.671+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">that gathered below the hall of the Chāngyì Prince.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:56:39.671+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The prince ordered someone to shoot and kill it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:56:39.671+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that it was a water bird whose color was green.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:56:39.671+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Green is an omen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:56:39.671+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, the prince raced around without restraint, showing disrespect to ministers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-176a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:56:39.671+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and treated high officials with contempt.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:57:43.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The bird was black,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:57:43.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">close to a black omen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:57:43.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">of the greedy and cruel type.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:57:43.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Book of Changes* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:57:43.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The bird burns its nest,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:57:43.698+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the traveler first laughs and then wails."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:19.58+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wáng Mǎng was greedy and cruel, yet was entrusted with the weight of the state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:19.58+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">ultimately bringing about the calamity of a change of dynasty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:19.58+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's *Yì Zhuàn* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:19.58+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When a ruler is tyrannical and cruel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-177a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:19.58+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the bird burns its dwelling."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:19.58+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:52.891+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Grand Master of Ceremonies and the Director of the Imperial Clan who oversee the ancestral temples and the affairs of the imperial relatives,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:52.891+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and then entered the palace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:52.891+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Its lingering and informing people</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:52.891+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is fully prepared and deeply earnest.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:52.891+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Even if people warned each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:58:52.891+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">how could it be any more than this!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:59:29.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and you drive out in your carriage every day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:59:29.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">unrestrained in your behavior, which is widely rumored.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:59:29.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The entire country is talking about it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:59:29.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">even more so than the capital.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:59:29.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">There are the harms of secret travels outside,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-178a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T16:59:29.268+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the worry of illness within.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:31.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When treacherous ministers are in the country,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:31.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the calamity is that swallows give birth to sparrows."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">「賊臣在國，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the fault lies in the swallow's nest being destroyed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:31.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Another saying is:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">One interpretation is:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:31.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">They gave birth to something not of their kind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:31.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">meaning that sons will not succeed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">that which is born is not of its kind;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:31.973+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-179a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the son will not inherit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Shǐjì* (Records of the Grand Historian), during the time of Lǔ Dìnggōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jì Huánzǐ dug a well,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and found an insect resembling a sheep within it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this was a harbinger of misfortune related to sheep.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Sheep are</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">creatures of the earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yet hidden in the earth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this symbolizes Dìnggōng not employing Kǒngzǐ but listening to the Jì clan,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a response of obscurity and lack of clarity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">One interpretation is:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a sheep leaving the wilderness and being confined to an earthenware jar</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">symbolizes the ruler of Lǔ losing his proper place and being confined by the Jì clan;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Jì clan will also be confined by their household ministers.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In that year, Yáng Hǔ, the household minister of the Jì clan, imprisoned Jì Huánzǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Three years later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yáng Hǔ kidnapped the duke and attacked the Mèng clan,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">but his army was defeated,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-180a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">so he stole precious jades and a great bow and fled.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Zuǒzhuàn*, during the time of Lǔ Xiānggōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in Sòng there was a girl born red and hairy;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">she was abandoned below a dike.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">A servant of Gòng Jī, the mother of Sòng Pínggōng, saw her and took her in,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and consequently named her Qì.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">She grew up to be beautiful</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and was presented to Pínggōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and she bore a son named Zuǒ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:00:33.343+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, the Sòng minister Yī Lì slandered the heir apparent Cuó and had him killed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:01:50.466+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">A servant of the mother of Duke Píng of Sòng, Gòng Jī, saw her and took her in,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:01:50.466+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore she was named Qì.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:01:50.466+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">She grew up beautiful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:01:50.466+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and was presented to Duke Píng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:01:50.466+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and gave birth to a son named Zuǒ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-181a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:01:50.466+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Later, the Sòng minister Yī Lì slandered the crown prince Cuó and killed him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-182a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:21.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">as well as kings who should not have been enthroned.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-182a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:21.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Wáng Líng 王陵, Zhào Yáo 趙堯, and Zhōu Chāng 周昌 were dismissed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-182a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:21.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When Empress Lǚ 呂 died,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-182a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:21.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the ministers together executed and exterminated the Lǚ 呂 family,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-182a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:21.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and corpses lay bleeding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-182a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:21.672+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's 京房 *Yì Zhuàn* 易傳 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-183a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:58.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the high officials Dǒng Xián 董賢 and others were all exiled to distant places,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-183a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:58.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">resembling the Lǚ 呂 clan.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-183a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:58.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Those who were executed were few,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-183a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:58.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">so the rain of blood was also small.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-184a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:58.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-184a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:02:58.669+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Zhuàn* 傳 says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:03:33.852+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore his punishment is constant cold.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:03:33.852+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When it is cold, the various grains do not grow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:03:33.852+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and both upper and lower classes are impoverished,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:03:33.852+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">therefore its ultimate result is poverty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:03:33.852+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If the ruler is stern and fierce and shuts off those below him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:03:33.852+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the ministers tremble and block their ears.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:03:51.401+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">chén zhànlì ér sè ěr, and the ministers tremble and cover their ears,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:14.256+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">fán tīng shāng zhě bìng shuǐ qì, Generally, those whose hearing is damaged are ill with water qi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:14.256+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shuǐ qì bìng zé huǒ lì zhī. when water qi is ill, then fire harms it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:14.256+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">qí jí pín zhě, Those who are extremely poor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:14.256+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">shùn zhī, if they accord with it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:14.256+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">qí fú yuē fù. their blessing is called wealth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:14.256+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn tīng zhuàn yuē yǒu jiè chóng niè yě, Liú Xīn heard a tradition saying there are armored insect prodigies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:49.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">were torn apart by chariots as a public display,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:49.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and their clans were exterminated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:49.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">More than four thousand families were relocated to Fánglíng 房陵.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:49.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fourth month of that year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:49.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it was cold,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:04:49.129+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and some people froze to death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:05:26.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When virtuous people begin to leave, this is called injury,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:05:26.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and in the cold, things die without frost,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:05:26.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and water gushes out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:05:26.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Fighting without measuring the enemy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:05:26.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this is called humiliating fate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-185a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:05:26.248+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and in the cold, even when it rains, things do not flourish."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:05.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the tenth year of Duke Xī, "in winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:05.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was heavy rain and snow."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:05.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that before this, Duke Xī had installed a concubine as his wife,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:05.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yin occupying the Yang position,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:05.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Yin energy being dominant.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:05.081+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The "Gōngyáng Classic" says, "there was heavy hail."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the tenth year of Duke Lǐ's reign, "in winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was a great rain and snow."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that this was because Duke Lǐ first established a concubine as his principal wife,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">thus yin occupied the position of yang,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the yin qi was flourishing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Gōngyáng Jing* says, "There was a great rain of hail."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū believed that the duke was intimidated by Duke Huán of Qí</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and established a concubine as his principal wife,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">not daring to advance his other concubines.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, the omen of exclusive affection appeared as hail,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">all because he was gradually intimidated,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-187a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and practiced a policy of exclusive affection.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fourth year of Duke Zhāo's reign, "in the first month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was a great rain and snow."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that this was because Zhāo took a wife from Wú and made her the same surname,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">calling her Wú Mèngzǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The ruler acted above,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the ministers disobeyed below.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Furthermore, the Three Families were already strong,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and all despised the duke's actions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and feelings of contempt and disrespect arose.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū believed that Jìsūn Sù was in charge of the government,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-188a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the yin qi was flourishing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the sixth month of the fourth year of Emperor Wén,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was a great rain and snow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Three years later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Prince of Huáinán, Cháng, plotted rebellion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">was discovered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">exiled,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and died on the way.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's *Book of Changes Commentary* says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:06:17.826+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"When it snows in summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:07:25.163+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the King of Huáinán [淮南王] Cháng [長] plotted rebellion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:07:25.163+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which was discovered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:07:25.163+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and he was exiled,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:07:25.163+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">dying on the road.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:07:25.163+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's [京房] *Yi Zhuan* [易傳] says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-189a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:07:25.163+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Summer rain and snow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-192a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:09:17.542+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">accumulating to a thickness of five feet on level ground.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-192a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:09:17.542+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">That year, Imperial Censor-in-chief Zhāng Tāng, having committed a crime, committed suicide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-192a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:09:17.542+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Prime Minister Yán Qīngzhái, implicated in plotting against Tāng with his three chief secretaries,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-192a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:09:17.542+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">committed suicide;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-192a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:09:17.542+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the three chief secretaries were all publicly executed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-193a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:09:17.542+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-195a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:00.957+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it snowed;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-195a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:00.957+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">many swallows died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-195a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:00.957+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Gǔ Yǒng replied,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-195a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:00.957+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The Empress is engaged in sericulture to make sacrificial robes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-195a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:00.957+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">participating in the affairs of Heaven and Earth and the ancestral temple.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-195a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:00.957+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Precisely on this day, a strong wind came from the northwest,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-196a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:32.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Sixteen years later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-196a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:32.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Empress Xǔ committed suicide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:32.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:32.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the first year of Duke Dìng, "in the tenth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:32.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">falling frost killed the beans."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:10:32.982+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng thought that this was the tenth month of the Zhou calendar.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:11:04.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Saying that "the grass was not killed"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:11:04.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">implies that the beans also did not die.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:11:04.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dǒng Zhòngshū (董仲舒) believed that beans</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:11:04.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">are the strongest type of grass.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:11:04.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Heaven's warning was as if to say,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-197a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:11:04.54+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Inflict punishment upon the powerful ministers."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-198a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:12:28.355+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in winter by rain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-198a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:12:28.355+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and then frost falls,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-198a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:12:28.355+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">with sharp points and edges.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-198a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:12:28.355+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When sages and worthies are harmed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-198a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:12:28.355+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the frost clings to trees and does not fall to the ground.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-198a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:12:28.355+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">When flatterers rely on punishments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:13:18.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which is congealed, stagnant, icy, and cold,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:13:18.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the *yáng* 陽 forces it without mutual penetration,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:13:18.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then it disperses and becomes sleet.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:13:18.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Therefore, boiling water in a closed vessel,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:13:18.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">if submerged in a cold spring,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:13:18.096+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">turns into ice.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:25.41+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">where will you stand then?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.129" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:25.41+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī then looked up to the sky and sighed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.130" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:25.41+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">tears streaming down his face, and said with a heavy sigh:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.131" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:25.41+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Alas!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.132" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:25.41+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I alone have encountered a chaotic world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Jūn hé chù yān? "Where is the lord?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.133" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:25.41+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and since I have been unable to die,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.129" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī nǎi yǎng tiān ér tàn, Then Sī looked up to the sky and sighed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.130" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">chuí lèi tài xī yuē: weeping and lamenting, said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.131" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Jiē hū! "Alas!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.132" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Dú zāo luàn shì, "I alone encounter a chaotic world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.133" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">jì yǐ bù néng sǐ, "since I cannot die,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.134" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">ān tuō mìng zāi! "where can I entrust my life!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.135" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Yúshì Sī nǎi tīng Gāo. Thereupon Sī listened to Gāo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Where is the emperor?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.136" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo nǎi bào Hú Hài yuē: Gāo then reported to Hú Hài, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.129" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī nǎi looked up to the sky and sighed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Jūn hé chù yān? "Where is the ruler?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.129" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī nǎi yǎng tiān ér tàn, Then Sī looked up to the sky and sighed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.130" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Tears streaming down his face, he lamented, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.137" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Chén qǐng fèng tàizǐ zhī míng mìng "Your servant requests to receive the Crown Prince's clear command</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.131" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Alas!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.138" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yǐ bào chéngxiàng, in order to report to the Chancellor;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.130" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">chuí lèi tài xī yuē: weeping and lamenting, said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:59.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Jūn hé chù yān? ("Where is the ruler?")</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.129" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:59.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī then looked up to the sky and sighed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.132" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I alone have encountered this chaotic era.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.139" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">chéngxiàng Sī gǎn bù fèng lìng! "how dare Chancellor Sī not obey the order!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.131" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Jiē hū! "Alas!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.130" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:59.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">tears falling as he lamented:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.133" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Since I cannot die,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.132" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Dú zāo luàn shì, Having alone encountered a chaotic age,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Jūn hé chù yān? (Where is the sovereign?)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.129" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Sī nǎi yǎng tiān ér tàn, (Sī then looked up to the sky and sighed,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.134" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Where can I entrust my life?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.133" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">jì yǐ bù néng sǐ, having already reached a point of being unable to die,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Yúshì nǎi xiāng yǔ móu, Thereupon they conspired together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.131" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:59.139+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Alas!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.135" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, Sī nǎi listened to Gāo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.130" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">chuí lèi tài xī yuē: (tears falling, he lamented:)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">zhà wèi shòu Shǐ Huáng fraudulently claiming to have received from the First Emperor</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.134" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">ān tuō mìng zāi! "Where can I entrust my life!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Where is the ruler?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.136" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo then reported to Hú Hài, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">zhào chéngxiàng, an edict to the Chancellor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.131" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Jiē hū! (Alas!)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.135" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Yú shì Sī nǎi tīng Gāo. Thereupon Sī listened to Gāo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.129" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, Sī nǎi (斯乃) looked up to the sky and sighed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.137" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Your servant requests to carry out the enlightened command of the crown prince</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.136" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo nǎi bào Hú Hài yuē: Gāo then reported to Hú Hài, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.132" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I alone encounter this chaotic world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">lì Zǐ Hú Hài wèi tàizǐ. establishing Zǐ Hú Hài as the Crown Prince.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.138" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to report to the Prime Minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.130" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Shedding tears, he lamented:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.137" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Chén qǐng fèng tàizǐ zhī míng mìng, "Your subject requests to carry out the clear commands of the Crown Prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.133" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and since I cannot die,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gèng wèi shū cì chángzǐ Fú Sū yuē: They further wrote a letter and bestowed it on the eldest son Fú Sū, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.138" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yǐ bào chéngxiàng, in order to repay the Prime Minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.131" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Alas!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.134" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">where shall I entrust my life!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Zhèn xún tiānxià, "I am touring the realm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.139" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">How could Prime Minister Sī dare to disobey!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.132" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I alone have encountered a chaotic era,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">dǎo cí míng shān zhū shén praying and sacrificing to famous mountains and various gods</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.139" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Chéngxiàng Sī gǎn bù fèng lìng! "How dare the Prime Minister Sī not obey the order!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.135" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, Sī listened to Gāo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yǐ yán shòu mìng. in order to extend my lifespan.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, they conspired together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.133" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Having already been unable to die,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.136" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo then reported to Hú Hài, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Jīn Fú Sū yǔ jiāngjūn Méng Tián Now Fú Sū and General Méng Tián</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.137" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Your servant requests to carry out the clear command of the Crown Prince</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Falsely claiming to have received the First Emperor's</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Yú shì nǎi xiāng yǔ móu, Thereupon they plotted together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.134" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Where can I entrust my life?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">edict to the Prime Minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.135" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, Sī nǎi (斯乃) listened to Gāo (高).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.138" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to report to the Prime Minister;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">jiāng shī shù shí wàn lead troops numbering several hundred thousand</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">zhà wèi shòu Shǐ Huáng, falsely claiming to have received the First Emperor's</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Establishing Prince Hú Hài as the crown prince.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.136" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gāo (高) then reported to Hú Hài (胡亥), saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.139" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how could Prime Minister Sī dare not obey the order!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">zhào chéngxiàng, decree for the Prime Minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yǐ tún biān, to garrison the border;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Furthermore, they composed a letter bestowed upon the eldest son, Fú Sū, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:29:31.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">nǎi fǎn shù shàng shū yet you have repeatedly submitted memorials</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">shí yǒu yú nián yǐ, for more than ten years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:29:31.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">zhí yán fěibàng wǒ suǒ wéi, directly criticizing and slandering my actions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">lì zǐ Hú Hài wèi tàizǐ. to establish the son Hú Hài as Crown Prince.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I am touring the realm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.137" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Your servant begs to carry out the clear orders of the Crown Prince</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.138" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">To report to the Chancellor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:29:31.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yǐ bù dé bà guī wèi tàizǐ, because you were not allowed to be dismissed and return to be the Crown Prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, they conspired together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Gèng wèi shū cì chángzǐ Fú Sū yuē: They further wrote a letter to the eldest son Fú Sū, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Praying to the famous mountains and various gods</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">bù néng jìn ér qián, have been unable to advance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Then he wrote several letters going against</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to prolong my life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">shìzú duō hào, and the soldiers have suffered great losses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:29:31.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">rì yè yuàn wàng. resenting and complaining day and night.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">my actions, directly speaking out and slandering what I have done,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-15a.139" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">How dare Chancellor Sī (斯) not obey the orders!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"Zhèn xún tiānxià, "I am touring the realm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">falsely claiming to have received an edict from the First Emperor</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, he repeatedly submitted letters</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">addressed to the Prime Minister,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">dǎo cí míng shān zhū shén, praying to the famous mountains and various gods</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">wú chǐ cùn zhī gōng, without an inch of merit;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:29:31.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fú Sū wéi rénzǐ bù xiào, Fú Sū as a son is unfilial;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, Fú Sū and General Méng Tián</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">directly criticizing what I have done,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and taking his inability to resign and return home as due to his position as the heir apparent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, he fabricated numerous letters to the emperor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yǐ yán shòu mìng. to extend my life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon he fabricated numerous memorials</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">establishing the son Hú Hài as the Crown Prince.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:29:31.084+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">qí cì jiàn yǐ zì cái! "let him be granted a sword to commit suicide!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he resented and longed for it day and night.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">lead hundreds of thousands of soldiers</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Thereupon, they conspired together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">using his inability to resign and return home as the excuse,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">directly criticizing and slandering my actions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">directly slandering my actions,</seg>
