ú Sū yǔ jiāngjūn Méng Tián, Now Fú Sū and General Méng Tián</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00">jiāng shī shù shí wàn, are leading troops of hundreds of thousands</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash">to garrison the border.</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00">For more than ten years,</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00">they have been unable to advance,</seg>
                        <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00">and the soldiers have suffered great losses,</seg>
                    </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to garrison the border.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and using his inability to resign and return home as grounds to declare himself the rightful heir apparent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">resenting and longing day and night.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Falsely claiming to have received the First Emperor's</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fúsū 扶蘇 is unfilial as a son,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">jiāng shī shù shí wàn, are leading troops of hundreds of thousands</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">harboring resentment and disappointment day and night.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I am touring the realm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fúsū 扶蘇, as a son, is unfilial.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">For more than ten years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">using the excuse of not being allowed to resign and return home as the crown prince</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">edict to the Chancellor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">let him be given a sword to commit suicide!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fú Sū 扶蘇 is unfilial as a son.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The general Tián 田, being with Fúsū 扶蘇 outside,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yǐ tún biān, to garrison the border.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">they have been unable to advance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to resent and long for (something) day and night.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">praying and sacrificing to the famous mountains and various deities</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Establishing Hú Hài (胡亥), the son, as the Crown Prince.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Grant him a sword to kill himself!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">They further forged a letter bestowed upon the eldest son, Fú Sū (扶蘇), saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">did not correct him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to prolong my life.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fú Sū 扶蘇 is unfilial as a son;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the soldiers have suffered great losses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Shí yǒu yú nián yǐ, For over ten years now,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">General Tián 恬 and Fúsū 扶蘇 reside outside,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I bestow upon him a sword to commit suicide!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">"I am touring the realm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, Fú Sū, together with General Méng Tián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">without achieving any significant accomplishment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it is right that he knew of his plot.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:23:37.357+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">grant him a sword to commit suicide!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">failing to correct him;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">General Tián 恬 and Fú Sū 扶蘇 reside outside,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">bù néng jìn ér qián, they have been unable to advance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Praying to the famous mountains and various deities</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He is disloyal as a subject,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">leading several hundred thousand troops</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Yet they repeatedly submit memorials</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it is appropriate that they knew of his plot.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">failing to correct his faults,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">shìzú duō hào, the soldiers have been depleted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">In order to extend my lifespan.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">let him be given death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">directly criticizing and slandering my actions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">As a subject, he is disloyal.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to garrison the border,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it is appropriate to conclude they are aware of his schemes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">wú chǐ cùn zhī gōng, without an inch of merit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Now, Fú Sū (扶蘇) and General Méng Tián (蒙恬)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and let his army be given to the assistant general Wáng Lí 王離."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">complaining day and night about not being allowed to return and become the crown prince.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Grant him death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He is disloyal as a subject.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">for more than ten years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Nǎi fǎn shù shàng shū, Instead, you have repeatedly submitted memorials,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">have commanded several hundred thousand soldiers</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He sealed the letter with the emperor's seal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">They harbor resentment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to garrison the frontier,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Give command of the army to the deputy general Wáng Lí 王離."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">I bestow upon him death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">zhí yán fěibàng wǒ suǒ wéi, directly criticizing my actions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and sent Hú Hài 胡亥's attendant to deliver the letter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">has been unable to advance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:36:34.586+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">All hail,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fú Sū, as a son, is unfilial;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">For more than a decade now,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He sealed the letter with the emperor's seal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the soldiers have suffered many losses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and the command of the troops shall be transferred to Assistant General Wáng Lí 王離."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:36:34.586+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is due to the excess of *yáng* in winter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:16.389+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he is hereby granted a sword to commit suicide!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">yǐ bùdé bà guī wèi tàizǐ, using the inability to retire and return as Crown Prince</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">bestowing it on Fúsū 扶蘇 in Shàngjùn 上郡.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Unable to advance forward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and dispatched Hú Hài 胡亥's retainer to deliver the letter</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">without an inch of merit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:36:34.586+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the latent *yīn* in summer.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">rìyè yuàn wàng. to harbor resentment day and night.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">He sealed the letter with the Emperor's seal,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">And many soldiers have been depleted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">When the messenger arrived,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Yet, he repeatedly sends memorials</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fú Sū wéi rén zǐ bù xiào, Fú Sū, as a son, is not filial.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:36:34.586+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and dispatched Hú Hài 胡亥's retainer to deliver the letter</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to grant to Fúsū 扶蘇 in Shang Commandery.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he opened the letter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">to Fú Sū 扶蘇 in Shàngjùn 上郡.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">directly criticizing and slandering what I have done,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Without an inch of merit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:36:34.586+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third year of Duke Zhāo,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:24:25.769+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Qí cì jiàn yǐ zì cái! "He is to be given a sword to commit suicide!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:26:24.375+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Yet they repeatedly submit memorials</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">When the messenger arrived,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:36:34.586+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"There was a great hailstorm."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-16a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:25:34.851+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">wishing to be dismissed and return to become the Crown Prince,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fúsū 扶蘇 wept, entered his inner chamber,</seg>
