                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">he has sent us to lead 300,000 troops to guard the border,</seg>
