                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and has ordered us to lead 300,000 troops to guard the border.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">and has ordered us to lead 300,000 troops to guard the border.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">You, sir, are serving as supervisor.</seg>
