                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">how can you be sure it is not a deception?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Please request a re-investigation;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it is not too late."</seg>
