                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">request a re-investigation and then die;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The messenger urged him several times.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">request a re-investigation and then die;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:09.532+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fúsū 扶蘇 was benevolent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it is not too late."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">it is not too late."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The messenger urged him several times.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:30:47.439+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">The messenger urged him several times.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fúsū 扶蘇 was benevolent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_087-17a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:31:18.871+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d38b4f25">Fúsū 扶蘇 was benevolent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Generally, hail</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is all due to excessive *yáng* in winter</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-200a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and latent *yīn* in summer.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third year of Zhāo Gōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was "a great rain of hail."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">At that time, the Jì clan held exclusive power,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the omen of coercing the ruler appeared.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhāo Gōng did not awaken to this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-201a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and later the Jì clan eventually drove Zhāo Gōng out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the twelfth month of the third year of Yuánfēng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was thunder, rain, and hail,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">as large as a horse's head.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fifth month of the fourth year of Dìjié during Xuān Dì's reign,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in Shānyáng and Jìyīn, there was a rain of hail as large as chicken eggs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">two chi and five cun deep,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">killing twenty people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and all flying birds died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the tenth month of that year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Grand Marshal Huò Yǔ's clan plotted a rebellion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">were executed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-202a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and Empress Huò was deposed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-203a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-203a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fourth month of the second year of Hépíng during Chéng Dì's reign,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-203a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in the state of Chǔ, there was a rain of hail,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-203a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">as large as axes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-203a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and flying birds died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Zuǒ Zhuàn* says that on the Jǐmǎo day of the twelfth month of the thirty-second year of Xī Gōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Duke Wén of Jìn died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">On the Gēngchén day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">they were about to encoffin him at Qūwò,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T17:56:09.057+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">setting out from Jiàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:00:10.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:00:10.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The *Zuǒ Zhuàn* states that on the day of jǐmǎo in the twelfth month of the thirty-second year of Lì Gōng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:00:10.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, Jìn Wén Gōng died;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:00:10.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">on the day of gēngchén</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:00:10.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, they were about to hold the funeral at Qūwò</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:00:10.042+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">, departing from Jiàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:11:51.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the disaster flowed for several generations;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:11:51.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">this was the effect of inauspicious evil.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:11:51.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:11:51.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the second year of the Jiànpíng era of Emperor Aì, on the first day of the fourth month, *yǐhài*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:11:51.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Imperial Counselor Zhū Bó was made Chancellor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:11:51.71+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Lesser Treasurer Zhào Xuán was made Imperial Counselor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">禍流數世，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">凶惡之效也。 Calamities flowing down through generations are the result of wickedness and evil.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">哀帝建平二年四月乙亥朔，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">御史大夫 Zhū Bó 為丞相，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">少府 Zhào Xuán 為御史大夫，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">臨延登受策，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">有大聲如鍾鳴，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">殿中郎吏陛者皆聞焉。 In the second year of the Jiànpíng reign period of Emperor Ài, in the fourth month, on the day yǐhài at the beginning of the month, the Grand Secretary Zhū Bó was made Chancellor, and the Master of the Lesser Treasury, Zhào Xuán, was made Grand Secretary. When they were about to ascend the platform to receive their mandates, there was a great sound like the ringing of a bell, which was heard by all the palace attendants.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">上以問黃門侍郎 Yáng Xióng、Lǐ Xún，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">尋對曰：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">「《洪範》所謂鼓妖者也。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">師法以為人君不聰，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">為眾所惑，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">空名得進，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">則有聲無形，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">不知所從生。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">其傳曰歲月日之中，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">則正卿受之。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">今以四月日加辰巳有異，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">是為中焉。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">正卿謂執政大臣也。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">宜退丞相、御史，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">以應天變。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">然雖不退，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">不出期年，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">其人自蒙其咎。」 The Emperor asked the Gentlemen-in-Attendance of the Yellow Gate, Yáng Xióng and Lǐ Xún, about it. Xún replied, "This is what the *Hóng Fàn* calls a 'drum demon.' The teachers of law believe that when a ruler is not wise and is misled by the masses, and empty reputations are advanced, then there is sound without form, and it is not known from where it originates. The commentary says that in the midst of the year, month, and day, the chief ministers will receive it. Now, adding the day of the fourth month to the *chén* and *sì* (times of the day) produces something unusual. This is what is meant by 'in the midst.' The chief ministers refer to the ministers in charge of the government. It would be appropriate to dismiss the Chancellor and the Grand Secretary in order to respond to the heavenly anomaly. However, even if they are not dismissed, within a year, those men will bring the blame upon themselves."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">揚雄亦以為鼓妖，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">聽失之象也。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">朱博為人彊毅多權謀，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">宜將不宜相，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">恐有凶惡亟疾之怒。 Yáng Xióng also thought it was a drum demon, a sign of impaired hearing. Zhū Bó was a man of strong will and many schemes, suitable to be a general but not a chancellor. It was feared that he would have wicked, angry outbursts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">八月，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T18:12:12.76+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">博、玄坐為姦謀， In the eighth month, Bó and Xuán were accused of engaging in treacherous plots.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">A calamity flowing through generations</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-204a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">is the effect of wickedness and evil.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the second year of Jiànpíng of Emperor Āi, on the first day of the fourth month, yǐhài (乙亥),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the Imperial Secretary Zhū Bó was made Chancellor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and the Lesser Treasurer Zhào Xuán was made Imperial Secretary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Lín Yán ascended the platform to receive the imperial decree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and there was a loud sound like the ringing of a bell.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The palace attendants and officials at the steps all heard it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Emperor asked the Yellow Gate Attendants Yáng Xióng and Lǐ Xún about it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xún replied,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"The *Hóng Fàn* refers to it as a drum omen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The teachers of law interpret it as when the ruler is not discerning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and is misled by the masses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and those with empty reputations gain advancement,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then there will be sound without form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and it will not be known where it originates.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The commentary says that in the middle of the year, month, and day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">then the chief minister will receive it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Now, if we add the day of the fourth month to the *chén* (辰) and *sì* (巳) positions, there is something unusual,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">which is called the middle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The chief minister refers to the minister in charge of the government.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is appropriate to dismiss the Chancellor and Imperial Secretary</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in order to respond to the heavenly change.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">But even if they are not dismissed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">within a year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">those people will bear the blame themselves."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Yáng Xióng also considered it to be a drum omen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a sign of hearing being lost.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhū Bó was a strong and resolute man with many schemes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">suitable to be a general but not a chancellor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">I fear there will be a calamity of rapid and violent anger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the eighth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:08:43.898+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Bó and Xuán were accused of plotting treason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:38.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">a sign of a failure in listening.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is an image of listening and losing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:38.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhū Bó 朱博 was a strong and resolute man with many schemes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:38.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">suitable to be a general, not a chancellor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhū Bó 朱博 was a strong and resolute person, full of schemes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:38.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">It is feared that he will have angry outbursts of wickedness and impatience.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He was more suited to be a general than a minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:38.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the eighth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">I fear he may have fierce and swift anger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the eighth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:38.352+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Bó 博 and Xuán 玄 were accused of plotting treason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Bó 博 and Xuán 玄 were implicated in a conspiracy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Bó 博 committed suicide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xuán 玄's death sentence was commuted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's 京房 "Commentary on the Book of Changes" says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"If orders do not cultivate the root,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">those below will be uneasy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If metal moves for no reason,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it is as if there is a sound."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the "Historical Records", in the first year of the Second Emperor of Qín 秦,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was thunder without clouds in the sky.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 thought that thunder should rely on clouds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">just as a ruler relies on ministers;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it is the union of yin and yang.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Second Emperor did not care for the people,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and all the people harbored rebellious thoughts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In this year, Chén Shèng 陳勝 rose up,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the empire rebelled,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Gāo 趙高 caused chaos,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and Qín 秦 eventually perished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Another interpretation is that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">This is an image of hearing loss.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in the Book of Changes, "Zhèn 震" represents thunder,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhū Bó 朱博 was a strong and resolute person with many strategies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">He was suitable to be a general, but not a prime minister.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and also represents an impolite appearance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">I fear he will have a fierce and violent anger.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the "Historical Records", in the eighth year of Qín Shǐhuáng 秦始皇,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the eighth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Bó 朱博 and Xuán 玄 were implicated in a treasonous plot.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">river fish greatly surged upstream.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 thought that this was an omen of fish disaster.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Bó 朱博 committed suicide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Xuán 玄's sentence was reduced from death.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In this year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:51:39.327+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shǐhuáng's 始皇 younger brother, Lord Cháng'ān 長安君, led troops to attack Zhào 趙.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's 京房 *Yì Zhuàn* (易傳, Commentary on the Book of Changes) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"If orders do not emphasize fundamentals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">those below will be uneasy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">If metal suddenly moves on its own,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-205a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it is as if there is a sound."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Shǐjì* (史記, Records of the Grand Historian), the first year of the Second Emperor of Qin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">there was thunder in the cloudless sky.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 thought that thunder should rely on clouds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">just as a ruler relies on his ministers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it is a union of Yin and Yang.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The Second Emperor did not care for the world,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and all the people held a grudge and had rebellious hearts.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In that year, Chén Shèng 陳勝 rose up,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the world rebelled,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhào Gāo 趙高 created chaos,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and Qin subsequently perished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Another interpretation says that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">in the *Yìjīng* (易經, Book of Changes), *Zhèn* (震, the Arousing) is thunder,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-206a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">and it represents disrespect in appearance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Shǐjì* (史記, Records of the Grand Historian), the eighth year of Emperor Qín Shǐhuáng 秦始皇,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">river fish greatly ascended (the river).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 thought that it was a near omen of fish.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In that year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T20:52:18.191+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Emperor Shǐhuáng's 秦始皇 younger brother, Lord Cháng'ān 長安君, led troops to attack Zhao.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T21:10:28.989+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T21:10:28.989+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the *Shǐjì* 史記 (Records of the Grand Historian), in the eighth year of Qín Shǐhuáng 秦始皇 (First Emperor of Qin),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T21:10:28.989+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the river fish greatly ascended [upstream].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T21:10:28.989+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng 劉向 considered this a fish omen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T21:10:28.989+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In that year,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-207a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T21:10:28.989+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shǐhuáng's 始皇 younger brother, Cháng'ān Jūn 長安君, led troops to attack Zhào 趙.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-208a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:01:06.206+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">four generals led a force of 100,000 to conquer Nányuè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-208a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:01:06.206+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">establishing nine commanderies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:01:06.206+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:01:06.206+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the autumn of the fourth year of Emperor Chéng's Hóngjiā era,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:01:06.206+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">it rained fish in Xìndū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:01:06.206+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">the fish being five inches or less in length.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-208a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Sì jiàngjūn zhòng shí wàn zhēng Nányuè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-208a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">kāi jiǔ jùn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chéngdì Hóngjiā sì nián qiū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ yú yú Xìndū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cháng wǔ cùn yǐxià.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chéngdì Yǒngshǐ yuán nián chūn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Běihǎi chū dà yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cháng liù zhàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gāo yī zhàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">sì méi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Āidì Jiànpíng sān nián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dōnglái Píngdù chū dà yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cháng bā zhàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gāo zhàng yī chǐ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">qī méi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiē sǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng *Yì Zhuàn* yuē:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Hǎi shù jiàn jù yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xié rén jìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xián rén shū."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Huán gōng wǔ nián “qiū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">zhōng”.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn yǐwéi tān nüè qǔ mín zé zhōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiè chóng zhī niè yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ yú tóng zhàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng yǐwéi jiè chóng zhī niè shǔ yán bù cóng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Shì suì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gōng huò èr guó zhī pìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">qǔ dǐng yì yì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xīng yì qǐ chéng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Zhū zhōng luè jiē cóng Dǒng Zhòngshū shuō yún.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-211a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:04:53.96+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Four generals led an army of one hundred thousand to conquer Nányuè, opening up nine commanderies. In the autumn of the fourth year of the Hóngjiā era of Emperor Chéng, fish rained down in Xìndū, with lengths of five *cùn* or less. In the spring of the first year of the Yǒngshǐ era of Emperor Chéng, large fish appeared in the Běihǎi, six *zhàng* long and one *zhàng* high, four in number. In the third year of the Jiànpíng era of Emperor Āi, large fish appeared in Píngdù, Dōnglái, eight *zhàng* long and one *zhàng* one *chǐ* high, seven in number, all dead. Jīng Fáng's commentary on the *Yì* says: "If the sea frequently shows giant fish, then wicked men advance, and virtuous men are estranged." In the fifth year of Duke Huán, "autumn, locusts". Liú Xīn believed that locusts are a calamity caused by the oppression and exploitation of the people, a pestilence of shelled creatures, and the omen is the same as with fish. Liú Xiàng believed that the calamity of shelled creatures belongs to words that are not followed. That year, the duke received betrothals from two states, took a tripod and exchanged it for a town, and raised levies to build a city. All interpretations of locusts generally follow the words of Dǒng Zhòngshū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-208a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Sì jiāngjūn zhòng shí wàn zhēng Nányuè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-208a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">kāi jiǔ jùn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-208a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Sì jiàngjūn zhòng shí wàn zhēng Nányuè,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the autumn of the fourth year of the Hóngjiā era of Emperor Chéng, fish rained down in Xìndū, the fish being five *cùn* or less in length.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-208a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">kāi jiǔ jùn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ yú yú Xìndū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chéngdì Hóngjiā sì nián qiū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cháng wǔ cùn yǐxià.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the spring of the first year of the Yǒngshǐ era of Emperor Chéng, large fish emerged from the Běihǎi, six *zhàng* long and one *zhàng* tall, four of them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ yú yú Xìndū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Běihǎi chū dà yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cháng wǔ cùn yǐxià.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cháng liù zhàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Chéngdì Yǒngshǐ yuán nián chūn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gāo yī zhàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Běihǎi chū dà yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cháng liù zhàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">sì méi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gāo yī zhàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:39.213+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the third year of the Jiànpíng era of Emperor Āi, large fish emerged from Píngdù in Dōnglái, eight *zhàng* long and one *zhàng* and one *chǐ* tall, seven of them, all dead.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">sì méi.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Āidì Jiànpíng sān nián,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Dōnglái Píngdù chū dà yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">cháng bā zhàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gāo zhàng yī chǐ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">qī méi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiē sǐ.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Jīng Fáng's commentary on the *Yì* says: "When giant fish are frequently seen in the sea, it means that wicked people are advanced and virtuous people are alienated."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">"Hǎi shù jiàn jù yú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xié rén jìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-209a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xián rén shū."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In the fifth year of Duke Huán, "autumn, locusts."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">zhōng."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xīn believed that locusts were a result of greed and cruelty in taking from the people, being a pestilence of shelled insects, with the same prognostications as fish.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">jiè chóng zhī niè yě,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">yǔ yú tóng zhàn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">Liú Xiàng believed that the pestilence of shelled insects was related to words not being followed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">In that year, the duke received envoys from two states, acquired a cauldron in exchange for a town, and started construction projects to build a city.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">gōng huò èr guó zhī pìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">qǔ dǐng yì yì,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">xīng yì qǐ chéng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-210a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0">The various accounts of locusts all follow the interpretations of Dǒng Zhòngshū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2a0007_tls_019-211a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:11:42.064+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2a0007-en-aa5797c0"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-19a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">247 "Jì Zuì"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-20a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-20a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">"Jì Zuì" (All Soused),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-20a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">is about great peace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-20a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Drunk with wine and full of virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-20a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">men possess the conduct of virtuous gentlemen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-21a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-21a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Having been drunk with wine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-21a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">having been filled with virtue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-21a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">May the gentleman live ten thousand years!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-21a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">May you receive great blessings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-22a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-22a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Jì zuì yǐ jiǔ, The wine has made us drunk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-22a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">ěr yáo jì jiāng. Your dishes are all set out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-22a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Jūnzǐ wàn nián! May the lord live ten thousand years!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-22a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Jiè ěr zhāo míng. May you have great enlightenment!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-23a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-23a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Zhāo míng yǒu róng, Enlightenment is expansive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-23a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">gāo lǎng lìng zhōng. May you have a bright and good end.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-23a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Lìng zhōng yǒu chù, May your good end be prosperous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-23a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">gōng shī jiā gào. And the representative of the dead will announce good tidings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-24a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-24a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Qí gào wéi hé? What tidings will he announce?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-24a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Biān dòu jìng jiā. That the bamboo and wooden dishes are clean and good.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-24a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Péngyǒu yōu shè, That friends are assisting,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-25a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">shè yǐ wēi yí! Assisting with dignified manner!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-25a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Wēi yí kǒng shí, When the dignified manner is perfect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-25a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">jūnzǐ yǒu xiàozǐ. The lord will have filial sons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-25a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Xiàozǐ bù kuì, These filial sons will never fail,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-25a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">yǒng xī ěr lèi. May they grant you blessings forever.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-26a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-26a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Qí lèi wéi hé? What are these blessings?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-26a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Shì jiā zhī kǔn. That your house and family will be harmonious.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-26a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-05T22:13:25.339+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR1c0001-en-d908a995">Jūnzǐ wàn nián! May the lord live ten thousand years!</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
</TEI>